1
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:15,279
Peace be upon you, my Bey.

2
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:27,799
I came back to the lands you conquered, my Bey.

3
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:40,079
I must have a dark fate, since I
am praying at your grave and...

4
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:42,759
...I live your pain inside me.

5
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:48,519
I couldn't see you one more time
with my eyes in this world, but...

6
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,119
Your son Osman

7
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:57,794
...realized your dreams on
the lands where you came

8
00:04:57,806 --> 00:05:01,319
with a few men and
established a blessed state.

9
00:05:04,599 --> 00:05:07,039
I know I will see you in his face.

10
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,639
May your soul find peace.

11
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:15,119
May you rest well in your grave, my Bey.

12
00:05:29,599 --> 00:05:31,639
Aameen.

13
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,839
Come on Alps!

14
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:13,439
Osman!

15
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:26,919
Before my blood dries,
I will spill yours, Osman.

16
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:43,679
They are behind us. We don't have much time.

17
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:51,399
Thanks to Allah, we kept our
promise and saved the Beys.

18
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:54,038
We will get out of this forest.

19
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:59,319
My Bey, our Alps wait ahead,
but we are not more than a dozen.

20
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:02,119
These dogs have many men.

21
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:05,399
The bigger they come, the
harder they fall. Don't worry.

22
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:08,119
Now I think about which one's head I will take.

23
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:18,359
It's the sound of hoofs. They are here, my Bey.

24
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,038
Boran.

25
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:29,038
You will go to the black forest in the north.

26
00:08:29,039 --> 00:08:30,279
Make the preparations.

27
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:33,918
If we can't deal with them,
we will bring them to your place.

28
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:35,918
As you order my Bey.

29
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:36,839
Don't worry.

30
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:44,759
Let's go, we will go into
the forest from this side.

31
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:45,959
Okay my Bey.

32
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,879
Osman entered the forest.

33
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:33,999
You set this trap, Claudius.

34
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:39,679
You used the Beys as bait
and lured Osman into the trap.

35
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:43,639
Do you think Osman came with two Alps?

36
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:47,999
Do you think I didn't notice
Osman was luring us into a trap?

37
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,879
But I will ruin his trap.

38
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:54,279
Don't ever make the mistake
of underestimating your enemy.

39
00:09:55,560 --> 00:10:03,039
Would you risk your life and threw yourself
into fire for a commander you met two days ago?

40
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:06,279
Look, Osman threw himself into the fire.

41
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:09,839
Don't worry, I don't underestimate him.

42
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:12,279
I even see him as my equal.

43
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:15,279
This excites me a lot.

44
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:16,959
Excellent.

45
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:24,279
I also like fighting such an enemy and winning.

46
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:28,639
They went into the forest.
Let's follow the tracks.

47
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:43,919
Kismet, you take Sofia and
Halime and go to the tribe.

48
00:10:43,920 --> 00:10:46,919
Alps will come with you.
Sofia is entrusted to you.

49
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:51,679
Tell Osman Bey the situation,
alright? And I will go after Alaeddin.

50
00:10:56,680 --> 00:11:00,119
Kismet Hatun, I don't want to owe her.

51
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:02,239
They must help her survive.

52
00:11:08,319 --> 00:11:10,719
Mother, I will come with you.

53
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,879
No, daughter, I can't put you in danger.

54
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,519
You go with Sofia.

55
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:16,198
I won't leave my brother alone.

56
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:18,879
I made a mistake by escaping the tribe.

57
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:20,639
Let me make up for my mistake.

58
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,079
Halime.

59
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:25,759
Let me have the honour to
stand before my family, mother.

60
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:28,559
Didn't you say we will never be apart again?

61
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:30,719
Then wherever you go, I go.

62
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:32,119
Look at you...

63
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,599
Alright then. Come on.

64
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:03,919
My Bey.

65
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:04,959
Aykurt

66
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,159
What's the situation?

67
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:07,879
We're readying the traps, my Bey.

68
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:10,599
However, we do not have enough equipment.

69
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:12,438
We don't have many alps as well.

70
00:12:12,760 --> 00:12:14,879
We only need a handful of alps.

71
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:16,599
Do not worry.

72
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:19,438
The number of jackals does not fear a wolf.

73
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:23,039
Even if it is fire coming
towards us, we will put it out.

74
00:12:23,520 --> 00:12:24,919
Come on alps, get ready.

75
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:26,438
As you command, my Bey.

76
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:46,159
The attackers must be scouts!

77
00:12:46,319 --> 00:12:48,999
Their encampment must be near!

78
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:51,079
Alps, check everywhere!

79
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:52,438
We will find them.

80
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:54,519
We have to find them.

81
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:55,559
My Shahzade.

82
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,359
My Shahzade, are you alright?

83
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:06,359
Cerkutay Bey.

84
00:13:07,319 --> 00:13:09,318
I've done wrong to Alaeddin.

85
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:12,519
I was going to prevent
him from leaving the tribe.

86
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:14,159
Now, because of me..

87
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:18,198
Because of me, they are in Kucar's hand now.

88
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:22,879
My Shahzade.

89
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,759
Falling back was my idea.

90
00:13:25,760 --> 00:13:28,359
There is a way for falling
back also, Cerkutay Bey.

91
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:29,719
He is a Shahzade.

92
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:32,599
He should've taken his precautions.

93
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:35,079
One mistake he makes..

94
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:36,959
..is good for the enemy..

95
00:13:37,520 --> 00:13:39,479
..and terrible for alps.

96
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:41,519
However, still..

97
00:13:43,560 --> 00:13:45,479
..me hitting him..

98
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:51,198
Cerkutay Bey.

99
00:13:51,800 --> 00:13:53,359
Olcaytu must want..

100
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:59,119
He would want to kill them to make things even.

101
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,799
We need to find them.

102
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:05,198
We will.

103
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,399
We will, God willing.

104
00:14:08,319 --> 00:14:10,119
Mistakes will be turned right.

105
00:14:10,439 --> 00:14:13,879
Hearts will unite again, God willing.

106
00:14:13,880 --> 00:14:14,999
God willing.

107
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:16,999
God willing.

108
00:14:20,800 --> 00:14:23,399
However, if something happens to them..

109
00:14:25,040 --> 00:14:26,399
..then..

110
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:32,719
..I won't forgive myself.

111
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:40,159
They covered their tracks,
however, no holding back now!

112
00:14:40,160 --> 00:14:41,198
We will find them!

113
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:42,799
Mother.

114
00:14:42,800 --> 00:14:43,839
Yes?

115
00:14:44,160 --> 00:14:47,559
Aren't you mad at me for
running away from the tribe?

116
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:50,399
Let's find your brother first.

117
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:51,999
Maybe I will be.

118
00:14:53,520 --> 00:14:55,599
Do you remember what I told you?

119
00:14:55,880 --> 00:14:57,919
There is a good in every mistake.

120
00:14:58,160 --> 00:15:01,078
If you hadn't ran away
and fell in Begum's hands..

121
00:15:01,079 --> 00:15:04,759
..we wouldn't have learned about your
brother and Gonca being held, right?

122
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:06,078
You're right, mother.

123
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:08,519
Come on then.

124
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:10,479
Come on, show me your skills.

125
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:11,639
Halime Hatun.

126
00:15:13,319 --> 00:15:14,359
Mother.

127
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,959
You are a mother you can forgive.

128
00:15:19,280 --> 00:15:20,599
What about my brothers?

129
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:21,759
My father?

130
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:23,759
They will get really mad at me.

131
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:25,639
After learning that I ran away.

132
00:15:25,760 --> 00:15:26,879
Look here

133
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:29,999
When you see your father and brother..

134
00:15:30,040 --> 00:15:32,239
..look at them as you do now..

135
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:34,479
..open your arms..

136
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:36,639
..and hug them like this.

137
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:40,919
Then, they will forgive you.

138
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:50,318
Is it that easy?

139
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:51,639
Of course.

140
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:54,919
However, we need to find
your brother first. Come on.

141
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:11,639
Mother.

142
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:16,559
We've found a track,
even if it's not my brother.

143
00:16:24,280 --> 00:16:25,719
That is of Mogol.

144
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:31,919
That way.

145
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:32,919
Come on!

146
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:45,119
Come, come...

147
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:10,559
Alps, release the arrows!

148
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:24,199
My Bey, that dog Claudius is not among them.

149
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:26,239
I'm here, Osman!

150
00:17:28,319 --> 00:17:29,439
I'm right here!

151
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:38,679
You thought I didn't understand
the trap you've set for us.

152
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,199
We are the hunters now.

153
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,638
Is that so?

154
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:52,399
My Bey, we're surrounded. What will we do?

155
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:53,959
Then..

156
00:17:55,560 --> 00:17:56,679
..I will put..

157
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:59,359
..both of you in the same grave.

158
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:00,679
Attack!

159
00:18:48,080 --> 00:18:49,839
Boran, we're falling back.

160
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:00,319
Osman!

161
00:19:04,440 --> 00:19:08,519
You have no place to run! Come here!

162
00:19:13,600 --> 00:19:14,679
Osman!

163
00:19:16,200 --> 00:19:17,279
Stop already!

164
00:19:18,360 --> 00:19:21,999
Your efforts were deserving of
applause. However, this is the end.

165
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:23,559
Do not worry.

166
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:27,439
We always have a road to go.

167
00:19:28,840 --> 00:19:30,999
We do not fall into desolation.

168
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:33,559
We never give up!

169
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:36,319
Stubbornnes, Osman!

170
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:38,999
You are only stubborn!

171
00:19:39,280 --> 00:19:42,399
You saved the beys with
this stubbornnes as well!

172
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:44,519
You know your enemy well!

173
00:19:44,760 --> 00:19:46,519
I am stubborn.

174
00:19:46,639 --> 00:19:48,319
And I never give up!

175
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,399
Know this!

176
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:55,159
I never come to the field with a single trap.

177
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:59,399
You are stepping on the second one.

178
00:20:01,360 --> 00:20:02,439
Attack!

179
00:20:21,120 --> 00:20:22,239
Ya Allah!

180
00:20:33,800 --> 00:20:35,398
Shield wall!

181
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:48,039
Those who play with wolves
bound to fall into a trap like a dog.

182
00:20:53,360 --> 00:20:55,239
These dogs just keep coming.

183
00:20:57,280 --> 00:20:59,319
Their death is near.

184
00:21:00,040 --> 00:21:01,319
Come on, to horses.

185
00:21:01,320 --> 00:21:02,439
Come on!

186
00:21:10,080 --> 00:21:11,159
Move!

187
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:18,039
Osman!

188
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:21,319
I swear I will live for this!

189
00:21:21,360 --> 00:21:24,799
I swear to you, I will live for this!

190
00:21:24,800 --> 00:21:26,999
I swear to you!

191
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:30,398
I will live for this!

192
00:21:41,399 --> 00:21:42,519
You dogs!

193
00:21:42,520 --> 00:21:43,599
Let go!

194
00:21:58,440 --> 00:21:59,719
You will wait..

195
00:21:59,840 --> 00:22:01,638
..Orlok Kucar in here.

196
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:05,759
He will make you pay for your disrespect.

197
00:22:06,399 --> 00:22:08,039
Put them into cages!

198
00:22:08,639 --> 00:22:10,239
Increase security.

199
00:22:10,520 --> 00:22:12,119
Not a bird will fly!

200
00:22:12,879 --> 00:22:15,319
Five guards will watch them.

201
00:22:15,760 --> 00:22:17,439
kill you.

202
00:22:17,639 --> 00:22:18,839
I'll kill you

203
00:22:19,760 --> 00:22:22,199
Let go!

204
00:22:24,639 --> 00:22:25,719
Let go!

205
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:42,279
Let go!

206
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:43,799
Don't touch me.

207
00:22:49,840 --> 00:22:51,119
Alaeddin

208
00:22:51,840 --> 00:22:53,878
Maybe my father thinks we've arrived.

209
00:22:54,600 --> 00:22:55,759
What will we do?

210
00:22:55,800 --> 00:22:57,398
How will we escape from here?

211
00:22:58,520 --> 00:23:01,039
They will do everything to not let us escape.

212
00:23:01,480 --> 00:23:03,039
They will.

213
00:23:03,560 --> 00:23:05,319
Kucar.

214
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:08,519
He will give me to Olcaytu to settle things.

215
00:23:10,399 --> 00:23:13,239
Now, these dogs won't leave our side.

216
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:16,559
My Gonca.

217
00:23:18,120 --> 00:23:19,719
It is me that they want.

218
00:23:22,080 --> 00:23:25,559
I won't allow you to be harmed.

219
00:23:25,560 --> 00:23:26,839
Never.

220
00:23:26,920 --> 00:23:27,999
Alaeddin.

221
00:23:29,080 --> 00:23:31,039
Alaeddin, they will kill you.

222
00:23:32,160 --> 00:23:35,559
Don't be sad, dear.

223
00:23:35,760 --> 00:23:37,199
No, Alaeddin.

224
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:39,319
Hatun.

225
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:45,759
..won't let them say the son
of Osman Bey died in a cell.

226
00:23:48,879 --> 00:23:50,519
No matter what happens..

227
00:23:52,040 --> 00:23:54,119
..I will walk to martyrdom with a fight.

228
00:24:11,000 --> 00:24:12,719
What is her condition, Ulgen?

229
00:24:13,120 --> 00:24:15,039
It was close to her stomach.

230
00:24:15,280 --> 00:24:18,119
She wouldn't have survived otherwise.

231
00:24:18,800 --> 00:24:20,239
She shouldn't have.

232
00:24:20,720 --> 00:24:23,479
We will not be sad for this snake.

233
00:24:24,480 --> 00:24:25,559
Fatma.

234
00:24:26,760 --> 00:24:28,559
She guarded Halime.

235
00:24:28,960 --> 00:24:31,839
We will at least show mercy.

236
00:24:32,320 --> 00:24:33,359
Right?

237
00:24:36,560 --> 00:24:37,519
Poena.

238
00:24:40,200 --> 00:24:42,559
I won't show no mercy, aunt.

239
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:45,919
Who knows what is my brother
and Gonca is doing right now?

240
00:24:46,399 --> 00:24:49,239
Am I supposed to think
about this spoiled thing now?

241
00:24:50,720 --> 00:24:53,599
There is good in every evil, Fatma.

242
00:24:53,720 --> 00:24:57,239
Besides, we could've ran off to
save Alaeddin and Gonca this way.

243
00:24:57,240 --> 00:25:00,319
That trickster goes after my brother even.

244
00:25:01,399 --> 00:25:03,519
What if I never see my brother again?

245
00:25:03,520 --> 00:25:04,759
You will.

246
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:06,638
Of course you will.

247
00:25:07,399 --> 00:25:08,519
not worry.

248
00:25:08,800 --> 00:25:11,719
They will return to the tribe alive and well.

249
00:25:15,440 --> 00:25:16,479
Poena.

250
00:25:57,720 --> 00:26:02,559
We came to the frontiers
to fight the infidels with him.

251
00:26:03,040 --> 00:26:05,119
Now what is he doing, Koca Bey?

252
00:26:07,360 --> 00:26:14,919
If Osman Bey made an alliance with
that sinister Sofia, he must have a reason.

253
00:26:15,399 --> 00:26:19,479
The blood of our people was
spilled by that infidel's sword.

254
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:23,878
He is a Bey. I would say
he knows the best, but no.

255
00:26:24,240 --> 00:26:26,439
This is a different matter, Koca Bey.

256
00:26:28,160 --> 00:26:36,319
Hasan Bey, if we fought the infidels once,
Osman Bey fought them a thousand times.

257
00:26:36,840 --> 00:26:39,319
He knows what to do very well.

258
00:26:40,399 --> 00:26:45,479
A Bey must stay calm in such times.

259
00:26:45,720 --> 00:26:47,638
He must be patient, Hasan Bey.

260
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:55,159
Now what we must do is
not complain like the people.

261
00:26:55,960 --> 00:26:59,079
We must stand tall next to our Bey.

262
00:27:08,360 --> 00:27:12,759
Come, listen to this old companion of yours.

263
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:37,999
My Shahzade.

264
00:27:49,320 --> 00:27:53,159
You took one of your children,
but I still have the other one, Bala.

265
00:27:54,399 --> 00:27:57,079
I swear I will make you suffer in pain.

266
00:28:18,680 --> 00:28:20,079
Demon.

267
00:28:20,280 --> 00:28:21,319
Traitor.

268
00:28:21,520 --> 00:28:23,959
She is still serving the Mongols like a dog.

269
00:28:24,800 --> 00:28:26,878
My Shahzade.

270
00:28:27,480 --> 00:28:30,999
Let's go and deal with that
witch who has nine lives.

271
00:28:31,000 --> 00:28:32,199
No.

272
00:28:33,879 --> 00:28:38,959
The ones with her are Kucar's loyal dogs.

273
00:28:40,200 --> 00:28:45,638
So the witch called Begum
started working with Kucar.

274
00:28:47,399 --> 00:28:50,878
Now we have the chance.

275
00:28:50,879 --> 00:28:52,398
Now we will follow them...

276
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:56,638
...and enter their nest.

277
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:20,039
My Osman Bey.

278
00:29:24,240 --> 00:29:27,158
Did they treat your wounds?
Are you feeling better?

279
00:29:27,159 --> 00:29:30,999
The real cure for our wounds...

280
00:29:31,080 --> 00:29:37,319
...is your victorious return from
Claudius and Kucar's nest, my Bey.

281
00:29:37,960 --> 00:29:40,199
You resisted Claudius well.

282
00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:45,279
I need Beys like you on my side.

283
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:49,279
Thank you.

284
00:29:55,120 --> 00:29:58,119
Who else do you want to
see on your side, Osman Bey?

285
00:30:07,879 --> 00:30:09,239
What happened, Hasan Bey?

286
00:30:20,240 --> 00:30:22,079
Say it directly.

287
00:30:23,960 --> 00:30:26,799
I mean that Hatun you made your ally.

288
00:30:27,840 --> 00:30:30,919
The infidel Sofia who has
martyr blood on her hands.

289
00:30:31,960 --> 00:30:33,079
Osman Bey.

290
00:30:36,200 --> 00:30:38,158
Are you going to unite us with her?

291
00:30:38,159 --> 00:30:39,279
Hasan Bey.

292
00:30:47,399 --> 00:30:49,919
How will we explain this to my father, Fatma?

293
00:30:56,399 --> 00:30:57,719
Know your limits.

294
00:31:01,920 --> 00:31:05,319
Do you think the blood of our
martyrs and their lost lives...

295
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:13,439
Do you think we never think or plan anything?

296
00:31:13,840 --> 00:31:14,999
Osman Bey...

297
00:31:15,960 --> 00:31:20,158
What reason can make
a Turk ally with an infidel?

298
00:31:23,920 --> 00:31:26,039
When you pledged loyalty to us...

299
00:31:26,560 --> 00:31:29,759
...did you come here only
to fight with your sword?

300
00:31:31,320 --> 00:31:35,319
Our cause is not just about being victorious.

301
00:31:38,520 --> 00:31:41,279
We are ruling a state here, a state.

302
00:31:41,360 --> 00:31:43,599
We are leading a path for the people.

303
00:31:43,840 --> 00:31:47,239
But sometimes, for future victories...

304
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:50,359
...we know we should make sacrifices.

305
00:31:52,080 --> 00:31:54,319
Such sacrifice must never be made.

306
00:31:55,960 --> 00:31:57,319
Hasan Bey.

307
00:31:58,480 --> 00:31:59,519
Koca Bey.

308
00:32:00,879 --> 00:32:03,279
Wait. Finish your words.

309
00:32:03,520 --> 00:32:07,559
I did not come to the frontiers to
unite with the infidels, Osman Bey.

310
00:32:07,800 --> 00:32:09,479
Turn back from this mistake.

311
00:32:09,639 --> 00:32:11,599
Turn back or else..
-No "or else".

312
00:32:14,120 --> 00:32:19,638
I won't entrust the state or the nation
to someone who questions a Bey's word.

313
00:32:30,120 --> 00:32:31,279
Hasan Bey.

314
00:32:34,960 --> 00:32:36,359
May your path be clear.

315
00:33:00,240 --> 00:33:02,878
All the Beys who are on the way...

316
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:08,239
...to come to the frontiers to pledge
allegiance to you will hear this, Osman Bey.

317
00:33:27,320 --> 00:33:28,878
Koca Bey..

318
00:33:30,360 --> 00:33:32,719
If you think like Hasan Bey

319
00:33:34,879 --> 00:33:36,759
May you go safely as well then.

320
00:33:38,000 --> 00:33:39,479
You too, Beys.

321
00:33:44,600 --> 00:33:49,919
I bowed this head to you
so you could be my leader.

322
00:33:50,360 --> 00:33:54,079
I would give up my head for your
path without question, my Bey.

323
00:33:57,040 --> 00:34:01,279
Hasan wants the same thing as well.

324
00:34:01,639 --> 00:34:04,439
But I couldn't understand why he did this.

325
00:34:06,000 --> 00:34:11,478
My own brother Yigit Bey is among
those who are coming to pledge allegiance.

326
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:14,237
He won't listen to Hasan.

327
00:34:16,560 --> 00:34:20,918
We never force anyone to pledge allegiance.

328
00:34:21,159 --> 00:34:23,799
If someone wants to leave the path...

329
00:34:24,840 --> 00:34:27,079
...they do it by their own choice.

330
00:34:27,480 --> 00:34:28,998
But know this...

331
00:34:30,080 --> 00:34:34,958
Our path will always be for gaza and conquest.

332
00:34:36,800 --> 00:34:43,757
If anyone doubts this, they will have
no place beside me or in my state.

333
00:34:43,800 --> 00:34:45,518
Everyone must know this.

334
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:53,158
In both west and east, enemies
make alliances against us.

335
00:34:53,880 --> 00:34:57,159
Now, we will see these
frontiers as our hunting ground.

336
00:34:57,560 --> 00:35:01,199
The fire of conquest will
burn so strongly that...

337
00:35:02,560 --> 00:35:05,199
...it will be seen even beyond the borders.

338
00:35:05,920 --> 00:35:10,999
We will burn the infidels
and the cruel ones alive.

339
00:35:11,000 --> 00:35:13,999
Yes my Bey.

340
00:35:22,240 --> 00:35:23,479
Here is my command.

341
00:35:25,240 --> 00:35:26,679
We will hold a council.

342
00:35:28,200 --> 00:35:35,959
Koca Bey, send word to all the
Beys under my rule and in my land.

343
00:35:36,360 --> 00:35:40,159
I want to see them all at this great council.

344
00:35:40,920 --> 00:35:43,439
As you order my Bey.

345
00:35:53,960 --> 00:35:54,839
Father...

346
00:36:00,480 --> 00:36:01,439
Fatma.

347
00:36:03,960 --> 00:36:05,278
Where is your mother?

348
00:36:05,960 --> 00:36:10,758
Halime left the tribe.

349
00:36:10,880 --> 00:36:12,239
My mother is after her.

350
00:36:37,080 --> 00:36:40,639
Alaeddin.

351
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:47,559
Brother..

352
00:36:49,720 --> 00:36:51,159
Kucar...

353
00:36:52,600 --> 00:36:56,439
I will show you that a Kayi
will never be a prisoner.

354
00:36:59,440 --> 00:37:01,679
Kucar is not here, my Shahzade.

355
00:37:01,680 --> 00:37:05,278
He is not here, but his precautions are strict.

356
00:37:06,000 --> 00:37:08,599
Even getting close is enough to be exposed.

357
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:12,387
If we make one mistake, everyone
in the quarters will draw their swords.

358
00:37:12,399 --> 00:37:13,559
Beys.

359
00:37:14,080 --> 00:37:16,519
What are the legends of our ancestors for?

360
00:37:16,759 --> 00:37:21,359
The soul of Kurshad, who raided the Chinese
palace with forty soldiers, is with us.

361
00:37:21,560 --> 00:37:25,359
Now, with that same faith and goal...

362
00:37:26,279 --> 00:37:28,278
.we will destroy this.

363
00:37:29,560 --> 00:37:31,359
...nest of looters.

364
00:37:33,800 --> 00:37:37,159
Shamil. Kanyumaz. Take Alps with you and...

365
00:37:37,520 --> 00:37:39,639
Inform Osman Bey.

366
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:44,479
My Shahzade, we cannot leave you alone.

367
00:37:45,520 --> 00:37:50,599
We needed you here so you
could go and inform Osman Bey.

368
00:37:51,360 --> 00:37:54,439
Go quickly now.

369
00:37:54,759 --> 00:37:56,359
As you order my Shahzade.

370
00:38:04,440 --> 00:38:07,079
Kucar's men were behind her.

371
00:38:08,560 --> 00:38:09,479
Begum...

372
00:38:11,240 --> 00:38:13,679
...works for Kucar, Osman Bey.

373
00:38:14,880 --> 00:38:16,039
Begum..

374
00:38:16,640 --> 00:38:19,679
How long will you keep
trying to make me kill you, huh?

375
00:38:20,160 --> 00:38:21,879
She touched my Poena...

376
00:38:24,000 --> 00:38:26,199
I will kill her.

377
00:38:27,200 --> 00:38:29,439
Begum is not the only ally of Kucar.

378
00:38:29,560 --> 00:38:31,199
There is someone else.

379
00:38:32,440 --> 00:38:34,159
I am talking about Claudius.

380
00:38:34,320 --> 00:38:35,639
Claudius..

381
00:38:36,840 --> 00:38:40,758
Did he ally with Kucar who set his
eyes on Bursa? This is ridiculous.

382
00:38:41,040 --> 00:38:42,999
I would never believe that.

383
00:38:43,160 --> 00:38:46,039
He would of course ally with him to rule Bursa.

384
00:38:47,920 --> 00:38:53,758
You are surprised by this but not
surprised that fate brought us together?

385
00:38:55,360 --> 00:38:56,519
Dastard.

386
00:38:58,160 --> 00:39:00,319
So, you betrayed the Emperor.

387
00:39:01,360 --> 00:39:03,799
You betrayed me once again.

388
00:39:05,400 --> 00:39:06,439
Osman Bey.

389
00:39:07,759 --> 00:39:10,919
Their alliance is a big threat to us.

390
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:12,799
You must prevent this immediately.

391
00:39:12,800 --> 00:39:16,278
My first duty is to protect my children.

392
00:39:16,920 --> 00:39:21,559
Olcaytu asked for a daughter
and a son for retaliation...

393
00:39:22,520 --> 00:39:24,959
...and now their lives are at risk.

394
00:39:26,720 --> 00:39:29,719
You said you spoke with Kucar to take Bursa.

395
00:39:31,840 --> 00:39:33,359
Do you know where he is?

396
00:39:34,279 --> 00:39:38,479
If you tell me where he is, I
can find Alaeddin and Gonca.

397
00:39:39,240 --> 00:39:42,799
I did not go there. Kucar came to Bursa.

398
00:39:44,720 --> 00:39:46,079
I don't know where he is.

399
00:39:50,080 --> 00:39:51,399
I wish I did.

400
00:39:58,759 --> 00:39:59,799
Osman Bey...

401
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:03,239
Find Poena.

402
00:40:04,560 --> 00:40:06,879
Don't let something happen to her.

403
00:40:07,040 --> 00:40:08,879
Her name is Halime.

404
00:40:10,120 --> 00:40:13,559
Even if you try to poison her,
she is with her mother now.

405
00:40:13,680 --> 00:40:15,919
She is after her family and her brother.

406
00:40:20,680 --> 00:40:23,278
You will never be able to break this bond.

407
00:40:30,799 --> 00:40:31,959
Poena.

408
00:40:34,680 --> 00:40:40,039
I won't let you slip away from my hands.

409
00:40:47,720 --> 00:40:48,959
What is she doing here?

410
00:40:50,320 --> 00:40:51,839
Alaeddin Bey.

411
00:40:54,680 --> 00:40:56,599
And his precious Hatun.

412
00:40:59,000 --> 00:41:02,319
Thanks to me, you finally
got what you deserved, huh?

413
00:41:03,000 --> 00:41:04,919
You treacherous snake.

414
00:41:06,120 --> 00:41:08,758
You keep serving the Mongols like a dog, huh?

415
00:41:09,480 --> 00:41:10,879
You served Ulugan first...

416
00:41:10,960 --> 00:41:11,839
After him..

417
00:41:12,640 --> 00:41:14,679
Did you sell your honour to Kucar?

418
00:41:15,680 --> 00:41:19,079
Are you the Kayi, those who lack honor?

419
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:22,239
You drew my Yusuf to your side..

420
00:41:22,320 --> 00:41:24,758
..pushing him to the front at every battle..

421
00:41:25,080 --> 00:41:27,119
..and finally took his life.

422
00:41:27,759 --> 00:41:30,119
He didn't choose treachery like you!

423
00:41:31,320 --> 00:41:32,639
Yusuf Bey's place..

424
00:41:33,240 --> 00:41:35,798
..is the sacred stop of our martyrs.

425
00:41:37,080 --> 00:41:38,599
Do not worry.

426
00:41:38,680 --> 00:41:41,359
You and your sister will share the same place.

427
00:41:42,200 --> 00:41:43,278
My sister?

428
00:41:45,960 --> 00:41:52,758
I am talking about Halime.

429
00:41:52,920 --> 00:41:55,359
You and your sister will die..

430
00:41:55,360 --> 00:41:59,359
..at the hands of Olcaytu in the end.

431
00:42:01,040 --> 00:42:02,519
You devil!

432
00:42:02,799 --> 00:42:05,559
So Kucar hired you to kidnap Halime!

433
00:42:06,279 --> 00:42:08,239
Don't you have any honor, Begum?

434
00:42:08,620 --> 00:42:14,080
Separating a child from her
family befits no honor!

435
00:42:14,440 --> 00:42:16,919
If you harm my sister in any way..

436
00:42:16,920 --> 00:42:20,879
..I will keep the promise I made
when you pushed my father into flame.

437
00:42:20,960 --> 00:42:22,959
I swear, I won't kill you.

438
00:42:23,240 --> 00:42:24,999
But you will be begging to die.

439
00:42:25,520 --> 00:42:26,719
My brother.

440
00:42:27,560 --> 00:42:29,278
Grows enmity towards me.

441
00:42:29,320 --> 00:42:31,079
He left this World.

442
00:42:32,480 --> 00:42:35,439
You don't have the words to scare me now.

443
00:42:37,360 --> 00:42:39,199
Besides, from what I've heard..

444
00:42:39,480 --> 00:42:41,399
..you found what you deserve.

445
00:42:41,759 --> 00:42:46,159
You became enemies with Orhan Bey.

446
00:42:46,240 --> 00:42:48,639
Everyone finds what they deserve in the end.

447
00:42:48,640 --> 00:42:49,639
Shut it!

448
00:42:50,600 --> 00:42:51,639
Look here!

449
00:42:51,640 --> 00:42:52,719
Look at me!

450
00:42:53,480 --> 00:42:54,639
Look at me!

451
00:42:55,560 --> 00:42:58,119
I am warning you one last time, hatun.

452
00:42:58,880 --> 00:43:00,479
If you..

453
00:43:00,840 --> 00:43:04,159
..harm any of my kin..

454
00:43:04,440 --> 00:43:07,199
..I will make this world
hell for you. Know that well.

455
00:43:10,720 --> 00:43:12,719
Don't make me laugh, Alaeddin Bey.

456
00:43:15,640 --> 00:43:16,959
In this condition?

457
00:43:17,160 --> 00:43:18,359
Come on, alps.

458
00:43:18,520 --> 00:43:19,599
We're leaving.

459
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:23,159
You laugh.

460
00:43:23,200 --> 00:43:24,319
Go ahead.

461
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:27,059
You won't be laughing soon.

462
00:43:35,720 --> 00:43:37,879
Trouble finds us.

463
00:43:38,520 --> 00:43:40,199
We laugh at times..

464
00:43:41,840 --> 00:43:43,758
..but we weep at the heart.

465
00:43:44,960 --> 00:43:51,919
A Bey must have a heart of iron to stay strong.

466
00:43:54,640 --> 00:43:56,879
That sorrow is what keeps us alive.

467
00:44:00,240 --> 00:44:02,999
Traitors always have tricks up their sleeves.

468
00:44:03,279 --> 00:44:04,439
However, it is about..

469
00:44:05,000 --> 00:44:06,159
..staying strong..

470
00:44:06,560 --> 00:44:08,359
..uniting and not falling.

471
00:44:08,720 --> 00:44:09,919
We will.

472
00:44:11,320 --> 00:44:12,639
We will.

473
00:44:13,600 --> 00:44:15,519
We will rise for the World of Islam..

474
00:44:15,880 --> 00:44:19,199
..and we won't allow these dogs..

475
00:44:19,680 --> 00:44:22,599
..who suck the blood of
innocent for worldly treasures..

476
00:44:23,880 --> 00:44:26,079
..and invaders of these lands.

477
00:44:37,000 --> 00:44:38,599
It is time, Cerkutay Bey.

478
00:44:38,840 --> 00:44:40,559
These dogs are leaving also.

479
00:44:42,640 --> 00:44:44,639
May you strike fast.

480
00:44:45,240 --> 00:44:47,999
Will we attack the encampment without Osman Bey?

481
00:44:48,759 --> 00:44:49,798
Kucar is not here.

482
00:44:50,040 --> 00:44:51,679
His warriors are leaving.

483
00:44:52,000 --> 00:44:55,039
There will not be a better time to attack.

484
00:44:56,120 --> 00:44:57,919
We need to sneak inside..

485
00:44:59,640 --> 00:45:01,239
..and deal with this.

486
00:45:02,160 --> 00:45:03,519
What if I get caught?

487
00:45:04,600 --> 00:45:05,919
Samil and alps..

488
00:45:06,799 --> 00:45:09,359
..will surely send word to Osman Bey.

489
00:45:13,240 --> 00:45:16,919
I was searching for someone more mad than me..

490
00:45:16,960 --> 00:45:19,639
..since Bamsi Bey gave me this sword.

491
00:45:20,120 --> 00:45:21,879
However, I finally found it.

492
00:45:25,720 --> 00:45:27,439
Tell me, my Shahzade.

493
00:45:27,759 --> 00:45:29,359
What do you have in mind?

494
00:45:30,040 --> 00:45:31,519
Follow me.

495
00:45:35,440 --> 00:45:36,719
Nilufer, Fatma.

496
00:45:37,160 --> 00:45:38,639
Take care of the tribe.

497
00:45:39,200 --> 00:45:41,039
Don't worry, father.

498
00:45:41,920 --> 00:45:42,999
Father.

499
00:45:44,640 --> 00:45:46,199
I do not..

500
00:45:46,200 --> 00:45:47,798
..trust that girl.

501
00:45:48,040 --> 00:45:50,879
I fear something will happen to mother.

502
00:45:50,920 --> 00:45:52,959
You take care of yourself too, alright?

503
00:45:52,960 --> 00:45:54,839
My daughter, what are you saying?

504
00:45:55,440 --> 00:45:57,519
Are you talking about Halime?

505
00:45:58,200 --> 00:45:59,919
There won't be such a thing.

506
00:46:00,200 --> 00:46:02,519
She is your kind.

507
00:46:03,400 --> 00:46:05,399
She is with your mother.

508
00:46:05,720 --> 00:46:08,798
She is fighting for the tribe, can't you see?

509
00:46:08,799 --> 00:46:09,798
Don't do this.

510
00:46:09,920 --> 00:46:13,119
Father, I can not stomach what she did.

511
00:46:13,880 --> 00:46:17,559
She is of our blood,
however, her soul is not of us.

512
00:46:17,640 --> 00:46:18,719
Fatma.

513
00:46:20,799 --> 00:46:21,879
Don't you say that.

514
00:46:22,680 --> 00:46:26,959
I will not hear something like
this from you again, alright?

515
00:46:29,480 --> 00:46:34,519
I won't allow disunion in this tribe.

516
00:46:37,120 --> 00:46:38,199
Look here.

517
00:46:39,480 --> 00:46:42,559
I won't allow it.

518
00:46:42,560 --> 00:46:43,758
Alright, Fatma?

519
00:46:48,440 --> 00:46:49,479
Nilufer.

520
00:46:50,360 --> 00:46:53,479
Sofia will not leave her tent no matter what.

521
00:46:53,799 --> 00:46:56,479
Do not keep your eyes off of her.

522
00:46:57,120 --> 00:46:58,439
As you command, father.

523
00:47:01,480 --> 00:47:02,519
Fatma.

524
00:47:10,720 --> 00:47:11,919
Come on, alps.

525
00:47:19,200 --> 00:47:20,278
Come on!

526
00:47:25,720 --> 00:47:27,919
Kucar did not lose any time, Hatun.

527
00:47:28,040 --> 00:47:30,758
He assigned the most
vile one to kidnap my sister.

528
00:47:30,759 --> 00:47:33,719
They couldn't succeed for now, however..

529
00:47:35,360 --> 00:47:37,399
..if this remains as their intention..

530
00:47:37,640 --> 00:47:39,719
..Halime will not be safe, Alaeddin.

531
00:47:40,520 --> 00:47:42,999
The heart just united with it's longing.

532
00:47:44,600 --> 00:47:46,199
What Begum did..

533
00:47:48,520 --> 00:47:50,879
I wonder if my mother is worried now.

534
00:47:51,560 --> 00:47:53,999
If she saw what we're like now.

535
00:47:54,480 --> 00:47:56,319
Her heart must be burning.

536
00:48:00,360 --> 00:48:01,479
No.

537
00:48:02,520 --> 00:48:03,639
We will not let..

538
00:48:03,720 --> 00:48:06,159
..my mother and my father feel this pain.

539
00:48:06,160 --> 00:48:08,079
Neither we nor my sister.

540
00:48:08,720 --> 00:48:11,798
We will not be captives of these dogs.

541
00:48:11,799 --> 00:48:12,879
We will not be.

542
00:48:57,600 --> 00:48:58,839
Alaeddin.

543
00:49:00,240 --> 00:49:03,519
Orhan Bey...
-Yes?

544
00:49:08,279 --> 00:49:10,479
He must've heard our situation, Hatun

545
00:49:10,720 --> 00:49:12,239
He found our tracks.

546
00:49:14,000 --> 00:49:16,439
Your brother did not leave you, Alaeddin.

547
00:49:16,520 --> 00:49:17,599
Yes.

548
00:49:26,279 --> 00:49:28,278
How will they take them out?

549
00:49:31,840 --> 00:49:33,278
With our help.

550
00:49:55,279 --> 00:49:56,599
I will get you out.

551
00:50:00,680 --> 00:50:01,879
Come.

552
00:50:05,560 --> 00:50:06,719
Brother.

553
00:50:23,840 --> 00:50:25,519
May you prosper, brother.

554
00:50:45,520 --> 00:50:49,039
So, the dogs of Osman gathers in our camp!

555
00:50:49,040 --> 00:50:50,359
You dogs.

556
00:50:50,840 --> 00:50:52,758
Your efforts are for naught!

557
00:50:53,160 --> 00:50:54,879
You will not escape!

558
00:50:54,880 --> 00:50:56,079
Surrender!

559
00:50:56,080 --> 00:50:57,839
When did we ever surrender?

560
00:50:59,960 --> 00:51:02,839
Hatun, you will escape in the first clash.

561
00:51:02,840 --> 00:51:05,559
I won't leave. I won't
leave you alone, Alaeddin.

562
00:51:05,560 --> 00:51:07,479
You will go and bring help.

563
00:51:08,040 --> 00:51:11,798
I will go. However, I will get
help and come back at once.

564
00:51:11,799 --> 00:51:12,719
Alright.

565
00:51:12,720 --> 00:51:13,758
Be careful.

566
00:51:13,759 --> 00:51:15,359
You too.

567
00:51:15,360 --> 00:51:17,039
Nokers!
(Mongolian Soldiers)

568
00:51:17,039 --> 00:51:18,169
Attack!

569
00:51:18,320 --> 00:51:19,599
Come on, hatun.

570
00:51:38,560 --> 00:51:39,519
Warriors!

571
00:51:39,520 --> 00:51:40,559
Take them out!

572
00:52:30,360 --> 00:52:32,319
I will butcher you all!

573
00:52:32,759 --> 00:52:36,599
I will let wolves feast on your dead bodies!

574
00:52:37,040 --> 00:52:38,639
I swear!

575
00:52:41,080 --> 00:52:43,239
Bring the sons of Osman to the cage.

576
00:52:43,640 --> 00:52:45,959
Take this used-to-be mongol with them.

577
00:52:46,120 --> 00:52:49,199
Kucar will decide on his fate when he arrives.

578
00:52:49,440 --> 00:52:52,278
Two of you, go after the running hatun.

579
00:52:52,440 --> 00:52:54,639
Come on, take them!

580
00:54:06,640 --> 00:54:08,879
If they won't give us Bursa..

581
00:54:10,440 --> 00:54:11,919
..then kill them all.

582
00:55:04,360 --> 00:55:05,758
Loyal servants..

583
00:55:06,920 --> 00:55:08,639
..of beautiful Bursa.

584
00:55:09,880 --> 00:55:10,919
Because Sofia..

585
00:55:11,680 --> 00:55:13,959
..has joined the enemy..

586
00:55:14,480 --> 00:55:16,839
..her days have ended!

587
00:55:19,720 --> 00:55:21,119
However, do not worry!

588
00:55:21,120 --> 00:55:23,119
I will save you..

589
00:55:23,320 --> 00:55:24,798
..from this pitiful..

590
00:55:25,160 --> 00:55:28,119
..situation you are in..

591
00:55:28,720 --> 00:55:33,399
..and bring Bursa to it's former glory!

592
00:55:35,080 --> 00:55:36,758
We will do it together!

593
00:55:37,120 --> 00:55:38,439
We will bring..

594
00:55:39,600 --> 00:55:42,359
..then end of Turks together!

595
00:55:42,880 --> 00:55:43,919
You..

596
00:55:46,040 --> 00:55:47,079
..stood against..

597
00:55:47,080 --> 00:55:48,319
..the Emperor, Claudius.

598
00:55:48,400 --> 00:55:50,239
That is rebellion.

599
00:55:50,440 --> 00:55:51,839
And the penalty..

600
00:55:52,240 --> 00:55:53,359
..is death!

601
00:55:55,400 --> 00:55:57,079
We will not serve you!

602
00:55:58,840 --> 00:55:59,758
Hristo?

603
00:56:06,680 --> 00:56:10,359
I gave you a chance to live.

604
00:56:11,680 --> 00:56:13,719
However, you do not deserve it.

605
00:56:20,360 --> 00:56:25,359
Besides, to hell with that
Emperor that you love so much!

606
00:56:25,440 --> 00:56:27,239
Kill them all!

607
00:57:10,360 --> 00:57:11,439
Stop!

608
00:57:11,440 --> 00:57:12,679
Or you die.

609
00:57:12,759 --> 00:57:14,359
Come and try then.

610
00:57:26,080 --> 00:57:27,159
Come on!

611
00:58:03,200 --> 00:58:04,719
Come on!

612
00:58:06,759 --> 00:58:07,798
Stop!

613
00:58:08,200 --> 00:58:09,879
Come on!

614
00:58:10,240 --> 00:58:11,479
She is done.

615
00:58:11,480 --> 00:58:12,519
Come on.

616
00:58:33,440 --> 00:58:34,199
Mother..

617
00:58:34,400 --> 00:58:35,959
..a horse rider is coming.

618
00:58:36,080 --> 00:58:37,278
Stay alert!

619
00:58:37,520 --> 00:58:39,758
Halime, stay behind me.

620
00:58:49,880 --> 00:58:50,959
Gonca?

621
00:58:56,240 --> 00:58:57,318
Gonca!

622
00:58:59,480 --> 00:59:00,559
My daughter!

623
00:59:02,240 --> 00:59:02,919
Hold on!

624
00:59:02,920 --> 00:59:03,679
My daughter!

625
00:59:03,720 --> 00:59:04,999
Come!

626
00:59:05,000 --> 00:59:09,439
Hold on! Hold her!

627
00:59:09,440 --> 00:59:10,798
Hold her!

628
00:59:10,799 --> 00:59:11,559
My daughter!

629
00:59:11,560 --> 00:59:12,839
Slowly.

630
00:59:12,840 --> 00:59:13,879
My daughter!

631
00:59:14,040 --> 00:59:15,879
My Gonca, are you alright?

632
00:59:19,920 --> 00:59:21,039
Hold her!

633
00:59:21,440 --> 00:59:22,959
My daughter, hang tight!

634
00:59:22,960 --> 00:59:25,079
Hang tight!

635
00:59:25,080 --> 00:59:29,879
Come on, In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

636
00:59:30,840 --> 00:59:32,439
It's over, Gonca.

637
00:59:32,440 --> 00:59:33,479
Gonca, look at me.

638
00:59:33,480 --> 00:59:36,159
My daughter, are you alright? Bring water!

639
00:59:36,640 --> 00:59:37,679
Are you alright?

640
00:59:40,319 --> 00:59:41,639
Give it here.

641
00:59:43,200 --> 00:59:44,798
Lift her up!

642
00:59:44,880 --> 00:59:45,919
Here.

643
00:59:46,799 --> 00:59:47,599
Gonca.

644
00:59:47,600 --> 00:59:49,159
Open your eyes, daughter.

645
00:59:49,160 --> 00:59:49,919
Look at me.

646
00:59:49,920 --> 00:59:51,559
Where were they keeping you?

647
00:59:51,640 --> 00:59:52,559
What happened?

648
00:59:52,759 --> 00:59:54,119
Alaeddin.

649
00:59:55,240 --> 00:59:56,758
Orhan Bey.

650
00:59:56,759 --> 00:59:58,199
Orhan came after you, yes.

651
00:59:58,200 --> 01:00:01,679
He fell captive.

652
01:00:09,279 --> 01:00:10,359
What?

653
01:00:11,000 --> 01:00:12,479
He fell captive.

654
01:00:15,680 --> 01:00:17,639
Gonca, where are they keeping him?

655
01:00:17,640 --> 01:00:19,359
Where are they keeping the sons, Gonca?

656
01:00:19,360 --> 01:00:20,599
Where are they keeping them?

657
01:00:20,600 --> 01:00:22,758
Gonca, open your eyes! Open your eyes!

658
01:00:23,440 --> 01:00:24,519
Alps!

659
01:00:24,520 --> 01:00:25,758
Ready the horse!

660
01:00:25,759 --> 01:00:28,159
Gulce take Gonca to the tribe!

661
01:00:28,160 --> 01:00:29,119
Come on, lift her up!

662
01:00:29,120 --> 01:00:29,999
Come on!

663
01:00:30,000 --> 01:00:30,839
Lift her up!

664
01:00:30,840 --> 01:00:31,959
Come on.

665
01:00:34,400 --> 01:00:35,639
Cerkutay Bey.

666
01:00:36,240 --> 01:00:37,559
Cerkutay Bey.

667
01:00:40,840 --> 01:00:42,278
You are alright, right?

668
01:00:50,080 --> 01:00:52,719
I am alright, my Shahzade, I am, but...

669
01:00:53,279 --> 01:00:58,278
Once I kill Kucar's men I will feel even better.

670
01:00:58,680 --> 01:01:00,119
The time will come for that.

671
01:01:01,319 --> 01:01:02,679
My Allah..

672
01:01:04,120 --> 01:01:06,679
Help my Hatun, my Allah...

673
01:01:07,720 --> 01:01:11,239
May You clear the path that my
rose Gonca is on from evil, my Allah.

674
01:01:14,799 --> 01:01:15,919
Alaeddin..

675
01:01:16,440 --> 01:01:17,519
Brother...

676
01:01:18,279 --> 01:01:20,439
Gonca is very good at riding horses.

677
01:01:20,680 --> 01:01:24,199
She must have already flown
to the tribe like the wind, huh?

678
01:01:25,200 --> 01:01:26,679
She must have, right?

679
01:01:26,680 --> 01:01:27,999
Yes, she must have.

680
01:01:29,240 --> 01:01:32,079
God willing she ran away and saved her life.

681
01:01:34,880 --> 01:01:36,879
She won't be able to escape!

682
01:01:37,600 --> 01:01:42,079
Soon, my nokers will bring her head to me!

683
01:01:44,680 --> 01:01:45,839
Don't!

684
01:01:46,080 --> 01:01:48,159
Don't you dare hurt my Hatun!

685
01:01:51,960 --> 01:01:55,039
Your fates have united as well.

686
01:01:55,960 --> 01:01:58,278
Don't worry.

687
01:01:59,440 --> 01:02:02,318
You will never be separated again.

688
01:02:10,279 --> 01:02:11,399
Kucar.

689
01:02:12,799 --> 01:02:14,318
You never understand, huh?

690
01:02:15,200 --> 01:02:17,758
You never see what is going to happen.

691
01:02:18,720 --> 01:02:20,639
This situation of us...

692
01:02:20,880 --> 01:02:22,719
...will not bring you victory...

693
01:02:23,799 --> 01:02:26,199
...but death. Death.

694
01:02:26,920 --> 01:02:29,919
Osman Bey's furor will
burn your heart in flames.

695
01:02:30,240 --> 01:02:31,599
You'll see.

696
01:02:34,600 --> 01:02:39,199
Osman... Osman...

697
01:02:39,480 --> 01:02:42,839
...now thinks he is playing a game against me...

698
01:02:43,440 --> 01:02:48,239
...after he notices your absence, he will
be devastated and he will understand that...

699
01:02:48,240 --> 01:02:51,758
...Kucar played the biggest game!

700
01:02:57,279 --> 01:02:58,479
Mankurt..

701
01:02:59,720 --> 01:03:01,839
Make sure you don't forget giving...

702
01:03:01,920 --> 01:03:05,479
...water and food to the Beys here.

703
01:03:07,680 --> 01:03:10,039
We need them.

704
01:03:11,640 --> 01:03:13,919
What about this Mongol defector?

705
01:03:14,120 --> 01:03:15,239
What about him?

706
01:03:15,360 --> 01:03:16,679
Did he say that to me?

707
01:03:19,360 --> 01:03:23,758
He will kill you all!

708
01:03:23,759 --> 01:03:24,839
Don't touch him!

709
01:03:26,920 --> 01:03:28,359
Don't touch him!

710
01:03:41,200 --> 01:03:42,599
...one of Osman's...

711
01:03:43,160 --> 01:03:49,239
...daughters for retaliation and go to Tabriz...

712
01:03:49,759 --> 01:03:51,879
...this one will come with us as well.

713
01:03:53,440 --> 01:04:01,559
Our Khan will make him pay for betraying us.

714
01:04:22,640 --> 01:04:23,559
Gonca.

715
01:04:26,279 --> 01:04:29,439
Gonca.

716
01:04:29,720 --> 01:04:30,839
Gonca, my daughter.

717
01:04:32,600 --> 01:04:33,719
She is badly injured.

718
01:04:34,440 --> 01:04:35,278
My daughter...

719
01:04:35,319 --> 01:04:36,798
Can you speak? Alaeddin..

720
01:04:36,799 --> 01:04:38,039
Where is Alaeddin?

721
01:04:43,240 --> 01:04:45,479
Kucar... You took Alaeddin..

722
01:04:45,480 --> 01:04:48,239
...now you will never find peace in this world.

723
01:04:48,240 --> 01:04:49,479
Tell me!

724
01:04:49,480 --> 01:04:51,758
Where are Bala and Halime tracking from?

725
01:04:51,840 --> 01:04:53,719
We parted ways at Kizilcinar, my Bey.

726
01:04:53,720 --> 01:04:56,159
They were going to track beyond that point.

727
01:04:56,279 --> 01:04:59,119
Is that so?

728
01:05:01,080 --> 01:05:05,159
Do not make Gonca wait here
any longer. To the tribe! Immediately!

729
01:05:05,680 --> 01:05:06,519
Go!

730
01:05:07,200 --> 01:05:08,199
Alps!

731
01:05:08,600 --> 01:05:10,559
We are going to Kizilcinar.

732
01:05:10,640 --> 01:05:11,758
Bring me the horse!

733
01:05:59,080 --> 01:06:00,919
Bursa now belongs to us!

734
01:06:00,920 --> 01:06:03,079
Kill everyone who resists!

735
01:07:18,160 --> 01:07:22,639
From now on, every border in these lands...

736
01:07:23,360 --> 01:07:27,278
...will be drawn by the tip of my sword.

737
01:07:29,400 --> 01:07:31,719
A new era is beginning in Bursa.

738
01:07:54,880 --> 01:07:59,599
Bring me the head of traitor Hristo.

739
01:08:00,880 --> 01:08:02,439
Right away.

740
01:08:14,600 --> 01:08:18,799
My Allah, may You protect my children.

741
01:08:20,080 --> 01:08:23,719
Protect them from the evilness
of enemies and from all troubles.

742
01:08:24,240 --> 01:08:28,679
May You surround each of their
steps with Your mercy and protection.

743
01:08:30,720 --> 01:08:33,038
Do not let us fall into separation, my Allah.

744
01:08:33,600 --> 01:08:35,679
Make us complete.

745
01:08:36,720 --> 01:08:40,358
You are the One Who wants reunions.

746
01:08:41,120 --> 01:08:43,238
May You bring us together as well.

747
01:08:45,160 --> 01:08:45,879
Aameen.

748
01:08:50,279 --> 01:08:53,398
Aameen mother. Aameen.

749
01:09:00,519 --> 01:09:04,078
Every time you say "mother"
my heart beats so differently.

750
01:09:05,680 --> 01:09:07,238
Come here, come.

751
01:09:16,479 --> 01:09:18,118
I don't know why, but...

752
01:09:19,080 --> 01:09:22,078
...every time I say "mother"
I want to say it more.

753
01:09:22,080 --> 01:09:25,438
Say it, my daughter. Say it as much as you want.

754
01:09:25,720 --> 01:09:28,158
Let's make up for the years we've lost, huh?

755
01:09:31,439 --> 01:09:33,318
Come.

756
01:09:45,359 --> 01:09:49,198
I used to be sad thinking I had no one.

757
01:09:51,920 --> 01:09:55,119
But it was all in vain.

758
01:09:56,720 --> 01:10:00,679
Were those years hard for you, my daughter?

759
01:10:00,760 --> 01:10:01,558
No.

760
01:10:03,280 --> 01:10:05,639
I didn't say it to make you sad, mother.

761
01:10:06,680 --> 01:10:11,759
Even though Sofia did evil things
to us, she was always good to me.

762
01:10:12,800 --> 01:10:14,199
She never tortured me.

763
01:10:16,320 --> 01:10:17,759
Poena!

764
01:10:18,640 --> 01:10:19,518
Sofia!

765
01:10:21,600 --> 01:10:24,919
Today, when she threw herself
in front of you, I believed her.

766
01:10:25,160 --> 01:10:30,319
But I won't forget the evilness she
did. The time for revenge will come.

767
01:10:34,360 --> 01:10:35,279
Mother..

768
01:10:37,400 --> 01:10:39,239
Will my brothers make peace?

769
01:10:41,880 --> 01:10:45,719
They are very close to each other, my daughter.

770
01:10:48,040 --> 01:10:53,719
If they can sit and talk face to face, it
will be solved, but they are stubborn.

771
01:10:53,880 --> 01:10:55,679
They are stubborn, my daughter.

772
01:10:56,400 --> 01:10:57,359
Then..

773
01:10:58,280 --> 01:11:02,119
...when we find my brother
Alaeddin, let's lock them in somewhere.

774
01:11:03,880 --> 01:11:07,759
Look, you thought of this
well. Maybe we can try it.

775
01:11:22,440 --> 01:11:23,759
My daughter.

776
01:11:25,559 --> 01:11:26,719
My dear daughter.

777
01:11:57,200 --> 01:11:59,399
Bala Hatuns fought here.

778
01:12:04,120 --> 01:12:05,999
They went this way.

779
01:12:06,320 --> 01:12:09,839
But they can't go any further at night.

780
01:12:09,920 --> 01:12:12,799
Surely... They will surely wait somewhere.

781
01:12:12,800 --> 01:12:15,199
What should we do, my Bey? What is your order?

782
01:12:15,200 --> 01:12:18,839
We will wait until tomorrow
morning to follow the right track.

783
01:12:18,920 --> 01:12:20,319
Remove these corpses.

784
01:12:22,040 --> 01:12:25,839
Set the fire here. Place a few Alps around.

785
01:12:40,960 --> 01:12:46,279
If you allow me, I want to name him Alaeddin.

786
01:12:49,880 --> 01:12:51,279
Sure.

787
01:12:56,160 --> 01:12:57,599
Alaeddin Ali

788
01:13:01,160 --> 01:13:02,599
My Alaeddin.

789
01:13:08,559 --> 01:13:10,959
How could you accept Alaeddin leaving?

790
01:13:10,960 --> 01:13:13,399
How could you be silent?
How could you let him go?

791
01:13:13,400 --> 01:13:15,159
I didn't accept anything.

792
01:13:17,000 --> 01:13:18,319
He said he wanted to go.

793
01:13:20,280 --> 01:13:21,639
And I let him go.

794
01:13:22,920 --> 01:13:24,359
My Alaeddin Ali.

795
01:13:26,600 --> 01:13:32,271
I will break the jaw of
anyone who sharpens their teeth

796
01:13:32,283 --> 01:13:38,079
against my children,
my family, or my nation.

797
01:13:40,280 --> 01:13:41,719
Don't worry.

798
01:13:42,400 --> 01:13:45,079
I will not leave you in the hands of those dogs.

799
01:13:45,440 --> 01:13:47,799
I will take you from them, Alaeddin.

800
01:13:48,920 --> 01:13:50,239
I will take you, my son.

801
01:14:03,960 --> 01:14:06,279
With that punch you threw, I thought...

802
01:14:09,920 --> 01:14:11,599
...I no longer had a brother.

803
01:14:14,640 --> 01:14:17,839
I thought my brother would
never talk to me again.

804
01:14:19,400 --> 01:14:20,199
But..

805
01:14:25,120 --> 01:14:27,558
...without knowing that I was captured...

806
01:14:28,600 --> 01:14:32,159
...you sensed that my life was
in danger and came right away.

807
01:14:33,160 --> 01:14:35,558
What else could I have done, brother?

808
01:14:37,680 --> 01:14:41,039
How could I leave you to
the mercy of those dastards?

809
01:14:42,240 --> 01:14:43,518
Tell me.

810
01:14:44,680 --> 01:14:47,558
If it were you, wouldn't you have done the same?

811
01:14:49,120 --> 01:14:50,439
I would have.

812
01:14:52,040 --> 01:14:57,239
If the mountains stood in front of me, I
would destroy them all and come to you.

813
01:14:57,840 --> 01:15:00,959
I would sacrifice my life
to protect yours, brother.

814
01:15:00,960 --> 01:15:02,359
You would.

815
01:15:03,559 --> 01:15:05,119
Sure you would.

816
01:15:06,160 --> 01:15:10,039
I, Alaeddin...

817
01:15:10,480 --> 01:15:16,279
...after my father, I trust only you in
this world. I lean my back only to you.

818
01:15:24,160 --> 01:15:26,319
But I was defeated by my anger.

819
01:15:27,360 --> 01:15:29,119
I parted ways.

820
01:15:31,040 --> 01:15:33,119
I turned my back on you, brother.

821
01:15:34,160 --> 01:15:35,119
No.

822
01:15:37,400 --> 01:15:39,239
You are not the only one...

823
01:15:42,680 --> 01:15:45,119
...who was defeated by his anger, my brother.

824
01:15:45,519 --> 01:15:48,319
Just because we had a conflict...

825
01:15:52,920 --> 01:15:55,799
...should not have thrown that punch at you.

826
01:15:57,480 --> 01:16:00,759
You turned your back on us. You left.

827
01:16:01,800 --> 01:16:03,999
But I am responsible for this, my brother.

828
01:16:05,920 --> 01:16:07,799
I broke your heart.

829
01:16:08,559 --> 01:16:10,479
No.

830
01:16:12,920 --> 01:16:16,359
If hearts are broken, they
are broken mutually, brother.

831
01:16:16,880 --> 01:16:19,479
I also said things I shouldn't have to you.

832
01:16:20,200 --> 01:16:22,919
You are older than me. So forgive me, alright?

833
01:16:23,120 --> 01:16:25,599
I would give a thousand lives for you.

834
01:16:27,160 --> 01:16:29,239
You forgive me too, my brother.

835
01:16:29,800 --> 01:16:31,479
Forgive me too.

836
01:16:32,720 --> 01:16:34,399
My lion brother.

837
01:16:35,559 --> 01:16:37,279
My lion brother.

838
01:16:38,440 --> 01:16:39,558
Look at you...

839
01:16:40,920 --> 01:16:44,279
These are the children of Dark Osman.

840
01:16:44,960 --> 01:16:48,518
The brotherhood that brings
the entire world to its knees...

841
01:16:49,519 --> 01:16:52,319
...that makes the enemy..

842
01:16:53,680 --> 01:16:55,079
...bow down.

843
01:17:13,680 --> 01:17:15,399
She lost too much blood.

844
01:17:16,200 --> 01:17:17,359
Ulgen sister...

845
01:17:17,440 --> 01:17:19,799
What if the medicine doesn't work?

846
01:17:20,760 --> 01:17:23,599
It will.

847
01:17:23,600 --> 01:17:25,799
Don't think of bad things, Fatma.

848
01:17:32,240 --> 01:17:33,199
She is waking up.

849
01:17:33,200 --> 01:17:34,119
Aunt.

850
01:17:35,160 --> 01:17:36,159
Gonca.

851
01:17:41,559 --> 01:17:42,439
Gonca.

852
01:17:45,120 --> 01:17:46,759
You scared us all.

853
01:17:47,120 --> 01:17:48,119
Are you alright?

854
01:17:55,400 --> 01:17:56,719
Alaeddin.

855
01:17:56,720 --> 01:17:58,839
Sofia told us, we know everything.

856
01:17:58,880 --> 01:18:00,799
My mother is looking for him.

857
01:18:01,120 --> 01:18:03,399
They will save Alaeddin, don't worry.

858
01:18:05,240 --> 01:18:08,959
Aunt, do you remember where they kept him?

859
01:18:11,000 --> 01:18:12,399
I don't know.

860
01:18:13,480 --> 01:18:15,479
I don't know where they kept us.

861
01:18:19,160 --> 01:18:23,079
Orhan came after you, didn't he?

862
01:18:23,519 --> 01:18:25,999
He did.

863
01:18:26,440 --> 01:18:27,319
Alright.

864
01:18:27,880 --> 01:18:29,999
Don't tire yourself more.

865
01:18:33,480 --> 01:18:34,639
Alaeddin...

866
01:18:35,680 --> 01:18:38,799
...and Cerkutay, Orhan...

867
01:18:41,760 --> 01:18:42,839
They all...

868
01:18:44,720 --> 01:18:45,679
They are all...

869
01:18:46,320 --> 01:18:49,039
They are all captured by Kucar.

870
01:18:56,800 --> 01:18:58,558
My Allah, protect them.

871
01:19:00,840 --> 01:19:02,119
What?

872
01:19:03,800 --> 01:19:05,079
Alaeddin..

873
01:19:17,800 --> 01:19:19,439
No.

874
01:19:19,480 --> 01:19:21,359
I will go after my brothers.

875
01:19:21,360 --> 01:19:23,439
I can't stay anymore. -Fatma.

876
01:19:23,680 --> 01:19:25,839
Will go against my father's command?

877
01:19:27,080 --> 01:19:28,199
Look.

878
01:19:29,080 --> 01:19:30,919
Father and mother are after them.

879
01:19:31,080 --> 01:19:32,479
They will rescue them.

880
01:19:32,480 --> 01:19:33,399
Don't worry.

881
01:19:33,400 --> 01:19:34,319
Sister.

882
01:19:34,640 --> 01:19:36,759
If I am not with my father and mother..

883
01:19:36,760 --> 01:19:42,159
..it is because of that girl.

884
01:19:42,160 --> 01:19:42,959
Look.

885
01:19:43,519 --> 01:19:45,719
While all of us suffer the same pain..

886
01:19:45,880 --> 01:19:48,199
..don't wear yourself out like this.

887
01:19:48,920 --> 01:19:49,719
Besides..

888
01:19:50,600 --> 01:19:52,759
..she is your sister.

889
01:19:52,920 --> 01:19:54,558
She is not my sister.

890
01:19:54,920 --> 01:19:58,799
She proved me right by pushing me into that pit.

891
01:20:18,080 --> 01:20:21,199
Now, all the lands are ours!

892
01:20:32,600 --> 01:20:34,839
So you were going to escape to Osman.

893
01:20:35,519 --> 01:20:37,799
There is no escaping from us!

894
01:20:40,160 --> 01:20:41,079
Father!

895
01:20:41,760 --> 01:20:45,759
Let go of my father!

896
01:20:45,760 --> 01:20:46,799
Let go of the kid.

897
01:20:47,960 --> 01:20:51,799
Let go of the kid.

898
01:21:09,519 --> 01:21:10,959
I told you to let him go.

899
01:21:10,960 --> 01:21:12,679
Who are you, old man?

900
01:21:12,840 --> 01:21:14,639
You can barely stand.

901
01:21:14,640 --> 01:21:16,919
Go away, don't find your trouble here.

902
01:21:26,280 --> 01:21:27,639
You will be punished..

903
01:21:27,640 --> 01:21:29,279
..for this, old man

904
01:22:13,280 --> 01:22:15,119
Come on.

905
01:22:22,680 --> 01:22:24,839
We owe you our lives, stranger.

906
01:22:24,960 --> 01:22:26,319
Who are you?

907
01:22:26,880 --> 01:22:30,639
One of Osman Bey's soldiers,
whom you never question his justice.

908
01:22:31,840 --> 01:22:33,759
Do you know Osman Bey?

909
01:22:34,880 --> 01:22:36,439
I know him well.

910
01:22:38,599 --> 01:22:39,799
Tell me, innkeeper.

911
01:22:40,760 --> 01:22:43,598
Do you wish to go to Osman Bey..

912
01:22:43,640 --> 01:22:46,119
..for the chaos going on in Bursa?

913
01:22:46,720 --> 01:22:49,759
Bursa had no justice before as well.

914
01:22:49,920 --> 01:22:52,359
With Ilhanids coming, it all went to chaos.

915
01:22:52,360 --> 01:22:55,079
Only Osman Bey..

916
01:22:55,400 --> 01:22:56,719
..can save us.

917
01:22:56,800 --> 01:22:58,639
Do not worry.

918
01:22:59,160 --> 01:23:00,679
I will take you to Osman Bey.

919
01:23:00,680 --> 01:23:01,598
Thanks.

920
01:23:01,599 --> 01:23:02,799
Go and prepare.

921
01:23:03,320 --> 01:23:05,199
Come on.

922
01:23:23,480 --> 01:23:28,558
My valiant Osman, you
fight against all infidels.

923
01:23:29,400 --> 01:23:31,558
This duty you took..

924
01:23:31,680 --> 01:23:33,839
..has even outgrown your fathers'.

925
01:23:59,320 --> 01:24:02,319
There was one son of Bey, now there is two.

926
01:24:05,320 --> 01:24:08,558
Here, come and eat.

927
01:24:09,720 --> 01:24:12,999
Alaeddin Bey is used to our hospitality!

928
01:24:16,280 --> 01:24:18,839
Say what you want to say.

929
01:24:19,320 --> 01:24:20,959
However, don’t keep it long.

930
01:24:21,240 --> 01:24:23,279
So now you've become "we" again.

931
01:24:27,080 --> 01:24:31,679
The might of Mongols has united..

932
01:24:32,720 --> 01:24:35,319
..two brothers that were against each other.

933
01:24:37,160 --> 01:24:38,839
However, it is all for naught.

934
01:24:41,840 --> 01:24:47,319
Do you think we have the
manners of a pig like you, Kucar?

935
01:24:48,920 --> 01:24:50,479
There can be resentment.

936
01:24:53,360 --> 01:25:00,159
However, brothers can not
have enmity against each other.

937
01:25:08,760 --> 01:25:10,159
Only enemy to the Turks..

938
01:25:11,240 --> 01:25:13,759
..are lowly tyrants like you.

939
01:25:15,360 --> 01:25:16,439
Are you done?

940
01:25:20,559 --> 01:25:23,039
You keep talking like this..

941
01:25:24,200 --> 01:25:26,959
..however, if you hadn't
gotten into each other..

942
01:25:27,360 --> 01:25:30,479
..you would escape the claws of the eagle.

943
01:25:32,720 --> 01:25:33,999
Ilhanids..

944
01:25:34,960 --> 01:25:38,399
..will rule the World..

945
01:25:38,400 --> 01:25:40,598
..by seperating the likes of you!

946
01:25:43,080 --> 01:25:44,598
Only Mongols..

947
01:25:45,519 --> 01:25:47,919
..always got seperated, Kucar.

948
01:25:48,280 --> 01:25:50,279
In the east, west..

949
01:25:50,559 --> 01:25:52,239
..north, south.

950
01:25:53,440 --> 01:25:54,999
Tell me.

951
01:25:56,040 --> 01:25:58,479
How many states do you have there?

952
01:26:01,680 --> 01:26:03,199
You must've forgotten.

953
01:26:05,000 --> 01:26:09,479
Even our seperation is
enough to rule the whole world.

954
01:26:12,320 --> 01:26:17,799
How many of you lost their heads
to come and conquer the borders?

955
01:26:18,599 --> 01:26:20,199
Do not forget those.

956
01:26:21,360 --> 01:26:23,359
So you will

957
01:26:23,920 --> 01:26:26,319
..make the grand Ilhanids headless?

958
01:26:28,680 --> 01:26:32,119
Take Byzantine as example, Kucar.

959
01:26:32,880 --> 01:26:35,558
They used to talk like you, Kucar.

960
01:26:36,360 --> 01:26:37,719
And now what happened?

961
01:26:37,720 --> 01:26:38,679
Do you know?

962
01:26:39,840 --> 01:26:41,479
Even our names alone..

963
01:26:42,760 --> 01:26:45,159
..bring fear into their hearts.

964
01:26:46,960 --> 01:26:48,919
For all these years..

965
01:26:48,920 --> 01:26:49,799
..only one..

966
01:26:50,040 --> 01:26:53,079
..or two brigades came to the borders.

967
01:26:53,480 --> 01:26:56,079
Have you seen the power of Ilhanids?

968
01:27:02,559 --> 01:27:04,919
We've received the news from Claudius.

969
01:27:07,240 --> 01:27:08,719
Now, Bursa is..

970
01:27:09,200 --> 01:27:11,039
..Ilhanid's land.

971
01:27:15,320 --> 01:27:17,359
What do you mean?

972
01:27:20,360 --> 01:27:21,558
What are you saying?

973
01:27:41,519 --> 01:27:42,439
So..

974
01:27:45,559 --> 01:27:46,639
..you think..

975
01:27:49,800 --> 01:27:55,558
..all those Ilhanids armies
came to the borders for nothing?

976
01:27:58,599 --> 01:28:00,919
..do you think I'm a simple messenger..

977
01:28:01,200 --> 01:28:05,039
..or shortsighted like Ulugan?

978
01:28:09,800 --> 01:28:12,799
..who made Bursa..

979
01:28:15,760 --> 01:28:20,439
..Ilhanids land with politics
without picking up my sword..

980
01:28:20,519 --> 01:28:22,639
..will not sheathe my sword..

981
01:28:25,920 --> 01:28:27,999
..when..

982
01:28:29,880 --> 01:28:30,999
..conquering..

983
01:28:31,000 --> 01:28:32,959
..the Kayi Tribe.

984
01:28:38,240 --> 01:28:40,359
We will demolish..

985
01:28:41,040 --> 01:28:42,439
..your politics..

986
01:28:44,519 --> 01:28:46,319
and your sword, Kucar!

987
01:28:47,280 --> 01:28:49,119
We will demolish!

988
01:28:51,440 --> 01:28:52,479
Now..

989
01:28:52,760 --> 01:28:54,518
..you don't even own..

990
01:28:54,880 --> 01:28:57,199
..your own life, let alone Bursa.

991
01:28:57,640 --> 01:28:58,759
Know that well.

992
01:29:02,320 --> 01:29:05,679
So the sons of a goat shepherd..

993
01:29:05,920 --> 01:29:08,598
..threatens Ilhanids..

994
01:29:10,160 --> 01:29:12,919
..with it's life, is that so?

995
01:29:25,840 --> 01:29:27,399
I'll see..

996
01:29:27,480 --> 01:29:29,719
..if you have the audacity..

997
01:29:30,080 --> 01:29:32,479
..once I bring you all..

998
01:29:32,680 --> 01:29:33,959
..to Olcaytu!

999
01:29:38,280 --> 01:29:39,558
You will see.

1000
01:30:19,200 --> 01:30:20,359
Stand back, daughter.

1001
01:30:20,760 --> 01:30:21,839
Stand back!

1002
01:30:41,840 --> 01:30:44,839
Hucar's lair must be nearby.

1003
01:30:45,559 --> 01:30:46,759
Be careful!

1004
01:30:48,519 --> 01:30:49,959
We will find them, mother.

1005
01:30:50,559 --> 01:30:51,839
We will, daughter.

1006
01:30:51,920 --> 01:30:53,319
I'm coming my sons.

1007
01:30:55,920 --> 01:30:56,959
Check around.

1008
01:31:07,559 --> 01:31:08,639
Stand your guard!

1009
01:31:09,880 --> 01:31:10,999
Halime.

1010
01:31:11,000 --> 01:31:12,239
Stand back, daughter.

1011
01:31:12,480 --> 01:31:13,919
I won't leave you alone.

1012
01:31:15,120 --> 01:31:16,359
Be careful.

1013
01:31:20,000 --> 01:31:21,199
Attack!

1014
01:31:33,120 --> 01:31:35,159
Fights like a lion.

1015
01:32:05,000 --> 01:32:06,839
What is happening, my Bey?

1016
01:32:11,080 --> 01:32:13,799
No resting before I have my sons!

1017
01:32:13,920 --> 01:32:15,359
I will only take lives!

1018
01:32:15,360 --> 01:32:16,399
Bala!

1019
01:32:39,240 --> 01:32:40,319
Bala!

1020
01:32:40,960 --> 01:32:41,999
Osman

1021
01:33:24,599 --> 01:33:25,639
Halime?

1022
01:33:36,040 --> 01:33:37,159
Halime!

1023
01:34:10,599 --> 01:34:11,639
My daughter.

1024
01:34:13,640 --> 01:34:15,719
Halime, are you alright?

1025
01:34:16,720 --> 01:34:17,839
I'm alright.

1026
01:34:18,280 --> 01:34:19,479
However..

1027
01:34:20,320 --> 01:34:21,359
..I won't be well..

1028
01:34:21,360 --> 01:34:24,039
..until my brothers are saved.

1029
01:34:26,120 --> 01:34:28,999
Orhan is at Kucar's hands as well, Osman Bey.

1030
01:34:32,040 --> 01:34:33,239
Bring that dog here!

1031
01:34:49,120 --> 01:34:50,359
Look..

1032
01:34:51,680 --> 01:34:53,919
Where is the nest of that dog Kucar?

1033
01:34:54,559 --> 01:34:57,399
Where?! Where is he keeping my children?

1034
01:34:57,760 --> 01:35:02,039
Stop. They are ahead. They are behind the hill.

1035
01:35:05,200 --> 01:35:08,759
Osman.

1036
01:35:17,240 --> 01:35:18,039
Osman.

1037
01:35:18,320 --> 01:35:22,399
Let's save our sons before we suffer
from the grief of losing another child.

1038
01:35:22,599 --> 01:35:23,999
Don't worry.

1039
01:35:24,519 --> 01:35:28,759
We will save them all. We
will save them all. Don't worry.

1040
01:35:28,760 --> 01:35:30,639
Let's go get them.

1041
01:35:39,360 --> 01:35:40,439
Now..

1042
01:35:42,559 --> 01:35:50,039
So, you say Bursa joined the Ilkhanate
with Claudius' rebellion, my Shahzade.

1043
01:35:51,160 --> 01:35:53,518
And against the Emperor's order.

1044
01:35:54,160 --> 01:35:59,558
So Claudius opposed the
alliance because of this.

1045
01:36:00,920 --> 01:36:04,518
Claudius didn't come to the
frontiers to fight for his state, brother.

1046
01:36:05,800 --> 01:36:10,159
Even under the Mongols,
he only wanted to take Bursa.

1047
01:36:13,280 --> 01:36:15,439
My fear is that, my Shahzades...

1048
01:36:17,240 --> 01:36:21,479
Sofia, who gave up Halime
Hatun to protect Bursa...

1049
01:36:21,480 --> 01:36:26,319
She might do anything if
she loses Bursa, you'll say.

1050
01:36:28,080 --> 01:36:29,518
That is possible.

1051
01:36:30,160 --> 01:36:35,359
She might continue the alliance
with us to get Bursa back as well.

1052
01:36:38,040 --> 01:36:40,279
You are right, brother, you are right.

1053
01:36:40,640 --> 01:36:45,319
But now, what we must do is act carefully.

1054
01:36:46,080 --> 01:36:48,719
You know very well...

1055
01:36:49,960 --> 01:36:51,879
...what Bursa being ruled by Mongols...

1056
01:36:53,559 --> 01:36:55,199
...means to us, brother.

1057
01:36:58,080 --> 01:36:59,479
Huh, Cerkutay Bey?

1058
01:37:02,000 --> 01:37:04,558
We know, of course we know.

1059
01:37:06,000 --> 01:37:10,639
The dream that my father had all his
life, the dream we grew in our hearts...

1060
01:37:13,000 --> 01:37:17,079
This will make it more difficult
for us to realize that dream.

1061
01:37:18,680 --> 01:37:23,919
Bursa is the door to the road of
conquests that goes way beyond.

1062
01:37:24,480 --> 01:37:29,079
Bursa is the unique stop on
the way to the RedApple for us.

1063
01:37:30,360 --> 01:37:31,919
If the Ilkhanate...

1064
01:37:33,920 --> 01:37:36,639
...takes the city permanently...

1065
01:37:37,840 --> 01:37:39,159
..then..

1066
01:37:41,400 --> 01:37:43,558
...then that door...

1067
01:37:45,080 --> 01:37:47,439
...will never open for us again.

1068
01:38:51,640 --> 01:38:53,518
O, old times...

1069
01:38:53,800 --> 01:38:57,119
The day you were conquered
feels like yesterday, Sogut.

1070
01:38:57,160 --> 01:38:59,959
So many martyrs have
fallen on this land for you.

1071
01:39:02,000 --> 01:39:06,639
The day you raised your glorious
banner here feels like yesterday, my Bey.

1072
01:39:27,800 --> 01:39:29,079
Peace be upon you.

1073
01:39:29,320 --> 01:39:30,839
Peace be upon you too uncle.

1074
01:39:30,840 --> 01:39:32,439
I want one oke of this.

1075
01:39:32,440 --> 01:39:34,239
I'll weigh it right away, uncle.

1076
01:39:36,720 --> 01:39:41,039
How is the trade going here? They say
taxes are too heavy for the people here.

1077
01:39:41,160 --> 01:39:42,359
No, uncle.

1078
01:39:43,519 --> 01:39:48,319
We had difficulty during Mongol
cruelty, but now taxes are reduced by half.

1079
01:39:49,519 --> 01:39:52,639
What you heard is true in
Byzantine lands, stranger.

1080
01:39:52,640 --> 01:39:54,679
This is the land of Osman Bey.

1081
01:39:56,440 --> 01:39:59,639
It's clear he won the hearts
of both Turks and Greeks.

1082
01:39:59,640 --> 01:40:02,079
But I don't know him. Who is this Osman Bey?

1083
01:40:07,519 --> 01:40:10,439
Uncle, how can you not know Osman Bey...

1084
01:40:10,440 --> 01:40:13,959
...who is famous for his justice
and has conquered many places?

1085
01:40:15,320 --> 01:40:16,839
Where is your Bey now?

1086
01:40:16,840 --> 01:40:18,799
My Bey sent word to all the other Beys.

1087
01:40:18,800 --> 01:40:20,919
He will hold a conquest council in the tribe.

1088
01:40:20,920 --> 01:40:23,319
If you go to the tribe, maybe you can see him.

1089
01:40:30,880 --> 01:40:32,839
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

1090
01:41:16,920 --> 01:41:20,359
Alps! Be careful, there might be a trap.

1091
01:41:26,440 --> 01:41:28,639
That's what happened, Yigit Bey.

1092
01:41:29,400 --> 01:41:33,479
Osman Bey betrayed the cause.

1093
01:41:34,320 --> 01:41:37,879
He works with the infidels who killed our men.

1094
01:41:38,920 --> 01:41:42,999
What hurts me the most is your brother Koca Bey.

1095
01:41:43,519 --> 01:41:45,759
He does not see what is happening.

1096
01:41:46,640 --> 01:41:48,999
He follows the wrong path of Osman Bey.

1097
01:41:50,120 --> 01:41:54,999
Hasan Bey, you cannot rest
in the shadow of an old tree.

1098
01:41:56,480 --> 01:41:58,999
Because you never know when it will fall.

1099
01:42:01,400 --> 01:42:06,119
I came here to invite you to a gathering.

1100
01:42:06,120 --> 01:42:09,479
What gathering is that? Who wants to see me?

1101
01:42:13,400 --> 01:42:17,399
Not only you, but all the Beys who came with me.

1102
01:42:19,840 --> 01:42:21,239
Orlok Kucar..

1103
01:42:22,640 --> 01:42:26,518
...is a cruel man who plants the seed
of evilness in the frontiers, Yigit Bey.

1104
01:42:27,800 --> 01:42:29,839
Do you also betray our way?

1105
01:42:30,040 --> 01:42:34,759
Never. The Beys want to see if
there is another way besides war.

1106
01:42:36,599 --> 01:42:39,439
But they will also see this effort is useless.

1107
01:42:40,920 --> 01:42:42,879
Does your brother know?

1108
01:42:43,080 --> 01:42:44,119
Not yet.

1109
01:42:46,400 --> 01:42:48,359
He will hear it when the time comes.

1110
01:42:52,599 --> 01:42:53,679
Come on!

1111
01:42:56,200 --> 01:42:56,999
Walk.

1112
01:43:23,880 --> 01:43:26,159
My Bey, Kucar...

1113
01:43:27,360 --> 01:43:29,879
Orhan and Alaeddin are in Kucar's hands.

1114
01:43:29,880 --> 01:43:31,079
Orhan Bey?

1115
01:43:31,120 --> 01:43:32,479
He was going to wait.

1116
01:43:32,640 --> 01:43:35,159
He sent us to inform you, my Bey.

1117
01:43:35,440 --> 01:43:38,839
He went there alone and
risked himself for his brother.

1118
01:43:39,240 --> 01:43:41,199
My Allah, don't take them from us.

1119
01:43:41,200 --> 01:43:45,759
We won't lose hope, don't worry.
One way or another, we will save them.

1120
01:43:46,080 --> 01:43:48,518
They won't hurt our family again.

1121
01:43:48,960 --> 01:43:50,839
Halime, come on, my daughter.

1122
01:43:50,920 --> 01:43:54,839
You are not coming with us. You
will return to the tribe with the Alps.

1123
01:43:55,480 --> 01:43:57,319
I don't want to go back, father.

1124
01:43:57,320 --> 01:44:00,919
My daughter, we can't throw
you into the fire. Go now.

1125
01:44:01,000 --> 01:44:03,959
If I leave your side, that's
when I fall into the fire.

1126
01:44:04,559 --> 01:44:07,119
Because of the days I
didn't get to live with you...

1127
01:44:07,120 --> 01:44:10,558
...I want to live every moment with you, my Bey.

1128
01:44:11,760 --> 01:44:15,799
Please let me be here with my family, my Bey.

1129
01:44:16,640 --> 01:44:18,719
Did you hear that, Osman Bey?

1130
01:44:18,720 --> 01:44:21,199
We are going to suffer because of her tongue.

1131
01:44:21,200 --> 01:44:23,639
She speaks so well and convinces us easily.

1132
01:44:23,640 --> 01:44:25,159
I wonder who she takes after.

1133
01:44:26,599 --> 01:44:28,079
I wonder who.

1134
01:44:29,280 --> 01:44:33,359
Anyway. My daughter.
But you will be careful, huh?

1135
01:44:33,400 --> 01:44:34,679
As you order my Bey.

1136
01:44:35,040 --> 01:44:37,719
Kucar's place looks like
an eagle's nest, my Bey.

1137
01:44:37,720 --> 01:44:40,399
My Bey, the precautions
at the quarters are strict.

1138
01:44:40,400 --> 01:44:43,119
No matter what, it doesn't matter to us.

1139
01:44:43,800 --> 01:44:48,359
As long as we have courage in
our hearts and swords in our hands...

1140
01:44:48,360 --> 01:44:50,439
...nothing can stop us.

1141
01:44:51,559 --> 01:44:55,319
They tested us with our children.

1142
01:44:56,519 --> 01:44:59,119
We will be death to them with our swords.

1143
01:45:32,360 --> 01:45:34,518
Allah is the Greatest.

1144
01:45:42,200 --> 01:45:44,279
Allah is the Greatest.

1145
01:45:47,800 --> 01:45:49,839
Allah is the Greatest.

1146
01:46:57,800 --> 01:47:01,479
Tell me everything is alright in Bursa, Hristo.

1147
01:47:01,920 --> 01:47:04,919
Claudius took over Bursa.

1148
01:47:08,880 --> 01:47:11,679
He also killed your loyal soldiers.

1149
01:47:12,120 --> 01:47:13,558
What are you saying?

1150
01:47:13,760 --> 01:47:15,199
I barely escaped.

1151
01:47:19,800 --> 01:47:21,279
Claudius..

1152
01:47:26,320 --> 01:47:31,999
After my father, now you betrayed me...

1153
01:47:35,880 --> 01:47:37,439
Bursa is mine!

1154
01:47:38,360 --> 01:47:40,159
I will never leave it!

1155
01:47:44,160 --> 01:47:46,199
Walk!

1156
01:47:46,200 --> 01:47:49,479
Fatma Hatun! This infidel Hatun wants to leave!

1157
01:47:49,599 --> 01:47:50,598
Alps!

1158
01:47:59,280 --> 01:48:01,598
You cannot keep me here.

1159
01:48:02,000 --> 01:48:04,039
It is the order of Osman Bey, Sofia.

1160
01:48:04,040 --> 01:48:07,719
Until he comes to the tribe,
you cannot take a step outside.

1161
01:48:07,960 --> 01:48:13,799
I am not Osman's subject.
I don't care about his order.

1162
01:48:20,240 --> 01:48:21,199
Come on, Hristo!

1163
01:48:21,200 --> 01:48:22,119
Sofia.

1164
01:48:22,480 --> 01:48:23,839
If we go there, we'll die

1165
01:48:23,960 --> 01:48:24,879
I will die!

1166
01:48:25,360 --> 01:48:27,159
But I won't stay here!

1167
01:48:30,519 --> 01:48:31,558
Move!

1168
01:48:35,880 --> 01:48:37,479
Clear the way!

1169
01:48:43,280 --> 01:48:44,598
Do not resist, Sofia.

1170
01:48:45,320 --> 01:48:46,518
Go to your tent.

1171
01:48:47,400 --> 01:48:49,518
Sisters will treat your wound.

1172
01:49:00,480 --> 01:49:01,598
Alps!

1173
01:49:02,599 --> 01:49:04,719
You take care of Hristo.

1174
01:49:06,519 --> 01:49:07,598
Let go.

1175
01:49:20,640 --> 01:49:22,079
Near Kucar Area

1176
01:49:42,120 --> 01:49:44,079
So you do your plans.

1177
01:49:48,599 --> 01:49:49,719
The sons..

1178
01:49:49,880 --> 01:49:52,919
..they never kneeled.

1179
01:49:52,920 --> 01:49:54,199
Do not worry.

1180
01:49:54,200 --> 01:49:55,239
Of course.

1181
01:49:55,440 --> 01:49:57,518
If they tried to chain them..

1182
01:49:58,080 --> 01:50:00,518
..they must've bite hard.

1183
01:50:04,680 --> 01:50:06,239
Halime, what are you doing?

1184
01:50:07,320 --> 01:50:09,679
Stand back.

1185
01:50:19,840 --> 01:50:21,518
What will we do, Osman Bey?

1186
01:50:21,680 --> 01:50:23,799
How will we rescue the sons from there?

1187
01:50:24,120 --> 01:50:25,799
We will, do not worry.

1188
01:50:26,280 --> 01:50:28,639
We will go around them.

1189
01:50:28,800 --> 01:50:29,839
Alps.

1190
01:50:30,920 --> 01:50:32,239
Follow me.

1191
01:51:26,200 --> 01:51:29,759
I've invited you as your elder.

1192
01:51:31,800 --> 01:51:36,319
And you responded..

1193
01:51:36,400 --> 01:51:39,079
..as a form of respect.

1194
01:51:42,800 --> 01:51:44,359
May you prosper.

1195
01:51:45,240 --> 01:51:46,959
Welcome.

1196
01:51:50,640 --> 01:51:51,999
Thank you.

1197
01:51:53,800 --> 01:51:55,839
By coming to me

1198
01:51:56,720 --> 01:51:59,079
..you chose peace, not war..

1199
01:52:00,599 --> 01:52:02,598
..you chose not bloodshed..

1200
01:52:03,240 --> 01:52:05,879
..but peace.

1201
01:52:11,000 --> 01:52:12,598
Everyone knows that..

1202
01:52:14,240 --> 01:52:15,839
..our ways and hearts..

1203
01:52:16,280 --> 01:52:18,839
..with beys are one.

1204
01:52:23,200 --> 01:52:25,518
We have not chosen anything yet, Kucar.

1205
01:52:26,519 --> 01:52:29,759
In these borders, that we
came to from a long way..

1206
01:52:30,519 --> 01:52:32,439
..we would like to..

1207
01:52:32,800 --> 01:52:34,879
..settle here.

1208
01:52:35,480 --> 01:52:37,039
However, we see that..

1209
01:52:37,880 --> 01:52:40,279
..all of our enemies..

1210
01:52:40,840 --> 01:52:41,919
..there..

1211
01:52:42,680 --> 01:52:44,399
..are on the same side.

1212
01:52:55,800 --> 01:53:00,598
While you promise peace to us..

1213
01:53:02,360 --> 01:53:03,799
..do you wish us to..

1214
01:53:04,519 --> 01:53:07,079
..be on the same side with our enemies?

1215
01:53:17,519 --> 01:53:19,638
Just because we didn't go to Osman Bey..

1216
01:53:19,960 --> 01:53:25,119
..and obeyed him, don't think
that we will embrace you, Kucar.

1217
01:53:27,200 --> 01:53:31,679
We will leave this place if needed, however..

1218
01:53:32,480 --> 01:53:33,959
..we will not obey you.

1219
01:54:20,920 --> 01:54:21,959
Boran.

1220
01:54:21,960 --> 01:54:22,999
My Bey.

1221
01:54:31,519 --> 01:54:34,558
Act fast with my shot.

1222
01:54:34,559 --> 01:54:36,199
We will ruin them.

1223
01:54:47,760 --> 01:54:48,999
Come then.

1224
01:54:52,480 --> 01:54:54,959
-Osman Bey.
-Father.

1225
01:54:54,960 --> 01:54:57,879
We will demolish this jackals' den.

1226
01:54:57,880 --> 01:55:01,319
They separated our sons from
us. And we will be their death.

1227
01:55:01,320 --> 01:55:02,439
Attack!

1228
01:56:16,040 --> 01:56:17,119
My Halime.

1229
01:56:20,599 --> 01:56:22,518
It is you, isn't it?

1230
01:56:23,920 --> 01:56:25,119
It is me, brother.

1231
01:56:29,040 --> 01:56:30,119
I'm Halime.

1232
01:56:35,040 --> 01:56:39,598
My dear, how I missed you.

1233
01:56:39,680 --> 01:56:42,239
Thank Allah, Who united us.

1234
01:56:52,680 --> 01:56:54,359
We will fight together now.

1235
01:56:56,720 --> 01:57:00,759
You look exactly like my
mother. You fight just like her.

1236
01:57:01,519 --> 01:57:04,199
Come on, follow me.

1237
01:57:11,040 --> 01:57:13,919
My children, are you alright?

1238
01:57:15,880 --> 01:57:17,518
The waiting was tiring, mother.

1239
01:57:17,519 --> 01:57:21,079
Now, we will butcher
these dogs and finally rest.

1240
01:57:28,680 --> 01:57:29,719
Mother!

1241
01:57:29,760 --> 01:57:31,239
Is Gonca alright?

1242
01:57:32,639 --> 01:57:33,679
She is alright!

1243
01:57:33,680 --> 01:57:35,719
She is at the tribe now.

1244
01:57:35,720 --> 01:57:37,039
Do not worry.

1245
01:57:50,639 --> 01:57:55,039
I am giving you the right to live.

1246
01:57:55,519 --> 01:57:59,959
I am giving you the chance of freedom.

1247
01:58:00,960 --> 01:58:02,558
You will see.

1248
01:58:07,160 --> 01:58:08,439
The power of the west..

1249
01:58:08,880 --> 01:58:11,239
..is in my hands.

1250
01:58:12,599 --> 01:58:14,239
The city of silk..

1251
01:58:14,920 --> 01:58:18,039
..the heart of trade, Bursa..

1252
01:58:18,840 --> 01:58:20,479
..is under my command!

1253
01:58:25,760 --> 01:58:28,239
Ilhanid Empire at the east..

1254
01:58:28,400 --> 01:58:29,679
..and it's servants..

1255
01:58:30,240 --> 01:58:31,679
..at the west..

1256
01:58:31,680 --> 01:58:33,518
..the soldiers of Byzantine.

1257
01:58:35,360 --> 01:58:37,239
Those who stay..

1258
01:58:39,200 --> 01:58:41,279
..between these two iron fists..

1259
01:58:42,639 --> 01:58:44,999
..have chosen death.

1260
01:58:49,080 --> 01:58:51,759
If you do business with Osman..

1261
01:58:52,120 --> 01:58:53,598
if you..

1262
01:58:54,200 --> 01:58:56,598
..even walk near him..

1263
01:58:57,000 --> 01:58:58,319
..you will all..

1264
01:58:58,320 --> 01:59:02,598
..face my wrath!

1265
01:59:13,720 --> 01:59:15,839
States are taken with swords.

1266
01:59:16,400 --> 01:59:18,119
However, the people

1267
01:59:18,639 --> 01:59:20,439
..can not be managed with sword.

1268
01:59:21,400 --> 01:59:24,399
We do not obey anyone!

1269
01:59:24,400 --> 01:59:26,159
-He is right.
-That's true!

1270
01:59:30,960 --> 01:59:33,319
I do not tell you to obey.

1271
01:59:35,240 --> 01:59:36,638
Owe your allegience!

1272
01:59:37,480 --> 01:59:39,079
So that I can share..

1273
01:59:39,080 --> 01:59:43,719
..the most important parts of these lands..

1274
01:59:43,720 --> 01:59:45,239
..the rivers, with you!

1275
01:59:49,360 --> 01:59:51,399
So that you can live..

1276
01:59:51,400 --> 01:59:53,279
..in your own land, freely.

1277
02:00:03,639 --> 02:00:08,598
Then, let us discuss this..

1278
02:00:09,920 --> 02:00:13,079
..with other beys.

1279
02:00:14,400 --> 02:00:15,679
Alright.

1280
02:00:16,320 --> 02:00:18,239
Wait for our response.

1281
02:00:19,160 --> 02:00:22,039
Orlok Kucar.

1282
02:01:04,559 --> 02:01:05,638
Ya Allah!

1283
02:01:05,639 --> 02:01:07,119
Strike them, valiants!

1284
02:01:18,680 --> 02:01:20,319
My sons.

1285
02:01:20,400 --> 02:01:21,919
My Bey.

1286
02:01:34,360 --> 02:01:35,439
My Bey.

1287
02:01:35,519 --> 02:01:38,319
I've brought shame to you by being captive.

1288
02:01:39,240 --> 02:01:41,839
I've brought my brother along with me.

1289
02:01:44,680 --> 02:01:46,119
It's my mistake.

1290
02:01:46,400 --> 02:01:47,558
Forgive me.

1291
02:01:48,200 --> 02:01:49,239
Brother.

1292
02:01:50,800 --> 02:01:52,439
My brother speaks true..

1293
02:01:52,599 --> 02:01:54,919
..however, he is missing the points.

1294
02:01:55,840 --> 02:01:57,879
We did this mistake together.

1295
02:01:59,639 --> 02:02:01,439
Forgive us, my Bey.

1296
02:02:02,400 --> 02:02:04,679
From now on, no matter what happens..

1297
02:02:05,480 --> 02:02:07,879
..we will not do the same mistake.

1298
02:02:10,040 --> 02:02:13,359
Shame suits those who fall
into despair. Do not be ashamed.

1299
02:02:13,400 --> 02:02:14,119
You..

1300
02:02:15,080 --> 02:02:17,039
..fought well.

1301
02:02:17,440 --> 02:02:18,799
May you prosper.

1302
02:02:18,880 --> 02:02:21,959
Stand tall.

1303
02:02:24,000 --> 02:02:25,799
..there is good in every mistake.

1304
02:02:26,400 --> 02:02:28,719
The infidel made you see the truth.

1305
02:02:30,280 --> 02:02:33,359
Do not stay seperated again
and upset my mother, alright?

1306
02:02:35,240 --> 02:02:36,638
Come here.

1307
02:02:36,639 --> 02:02:38,159
Come.

1308
02:02:38,440 --> 02:02:40,558
Look at what she's saying.

1309
02:02:41,160 --> 02:02:42,759
Yes, my Alaeddin.

1310
02:02:43,080 --> 02:02:46,479
She speaks plainly. She has a very sharp tongue.

1311
02:02:47,840 --> 02:02:51,638
So Halime will complete what Fatma shortfalls.

1312
02:02:52,280 --> 02:02:53,399
Now we're in trouble.

1313
02:02:53,400 --> 02:02:55,598
They will give us quite the trouble.

1314
02:02:56,480 --> 02:02:58,279
We have to endure it.

1315
02:02:59,480 --> 02:03:01,959
My Bey, that dog Kucar.

1316
02:03:03,160 --> 02:03:05,959
He was going to take us to Olcaytu..

1317
02:03:06,240 --> 02:03:08,359
..after capturing one of our sisters.

1318
02:03:09,280 --> 02:03:11,359
However, he is gone for a long time.

1319
02:03:13,720 --> 02:03:15,359
I wish he would come.

1320
02:03:16,320 --> 02:03:18,039
Our house is one now.

1321
02:03:18,360 --> 02:03:20,119
We are like a firm fist.

1322
02:03:21,320 --> 02:03:22,558
We will surely..

1323
02:03:22,559 --> 02:03:24,079
..punish for what he did.

1324
02:03:26,120 --> 02:03:27,839
What do you think, Osman Bey?

1325
02:03:30,040 --> 02:03:31,558
We can not leave here now.

1326
02:03:32,120 --> 02:03:33,839
We will spend the night here.

1327
02:03:34,360 --> 02:03:35,919
If Kucar comes..

1328
02:03:36,559 --> 02:03:38,319
..we will take his life, of course.

1329
02:03:38,680 --> 02:03:39,959
If he does not..

1330
02:03:40,400 --> 02:03:41,719
..we will take it later.

1331
02:04:06,000 --> 02:04:10,839
You did your duty well
during with the beys today.

1332
02:04:14,920 --> 02:04:20,319
Now you will have what you want.

1333
02:04:23,000 --> 02:04:24,119
However..

1334
02:04:25,120 --> 02:04:28,679
..use this chance well, Yigit Bey.

1335
02:04:39,200 --> 02:04:41,638
I will hone the beys slowly.

1336
02:04:42,400 --> 02:04:44,479
However, they all obey Osman.

1337
02:04:45,240 --> 02:04:47,759
They are as stubborn..

1338
02:04:48,559 --> 02:04:50,479
..to walk with him until death.

1339
02:04:51,400 --> 02:04:53,879
So you're saying that you can't.

1340
02:04:54,320 --> 02:04:55,399
It is difficult.

1341
02:04:55,800 --> 02:04:58,079
However, it won't escape my claws.

1342
02:05:00,800 --> 02:05:03,879
I will seperate beys one by one.

1343
02:05:07,440 --> 02:05:11,518
I will start from those who hate Osman first.

1344
02:05:15,840 --> 02:05:18,999
You're talking about those..

1345
02:05:19,120 --> 02:05:21,479
..who come from Osman's side.

1346
02:05:22,160 --> 02:05:23,399
Hasan Bey.

1347
02:05:27,320 --> 02:05:28,439
However..

1348
02:05:28,440 --> 02:05:29,919
..he hates Claudius.

1349
02:05:37,639 --> 02:05:40,598
I will seperate Osman from his beys also.

1350
02:05:42,400 --> 02:05:45,319
He will have nothing to stand on.

1351
02:06:01,920 --> 02:06:03,159
My daughter

1352
02:06:03,639 --> 02:06:05,039
What were you thinking?

1353
02:06:06,800 --> 02:06:07,919
How cute you are.

1354
02:06:10,559 --> 02:06:11,679
Mother.

1355
02:06:12,960 --> 02:06:15,359
We went with Gonca without a notice.

1356
02:06:16,200 --> 02:06:18,598
Your heart must've burned.

1357
02:06:19,960 --> 02:06:23,518
I thought that saying goodbye
like this would be easier.

1358
02:06:24,440 --> 02:06:25,799
Forgive me.

1359
02:06:31,400 --> 02:06:33,279
I forgive you, my Alaeddin.

1360
02:06:33,280 --> 02:06:34,719
I forgive you, my son.

1361
02:06:35,360 --> 02:06:37,719
You stay near me..

1362
02:06:39,400 --> 02:06:41,839
..and I'll erase all of your mistakes.

1363
02:06:48,320 --> 02:06:50,279
..seeing you all..

1364
02:06:52,800 --> 02:06:54,239
..like this..

1365
02:06:56,360 --> 02:06:59,079
..after all these years burns my heart more.

1366
02:07:01,000 --> 02:07:02,439
No, my daughter.

1367
02:07:02,840 --> 02:07:05,439
Think about the good days we will have.

1368
02:07:06,200 --> 02:07:07,638
Alright, my dear?

1369
02:07:14,360 --> 02:07:16,598
Just like my other children.

1370
02:07:20,510 --> 02:07:24,479
I escaped the tribe thinking you don't trust me.

1371
02:07:25,599 --> 02:07:28,229
While even I can not forgive what I've done..

1372
02:07:29,160 --> 02:07:30,959
..you've forgiven me.

1373
02:07:33,559 --> 02:07:34,719
So that's what it means..

1374
02:07:35,320 --> 02:07:36,598
..to be family.

1375
02:07:37,040 --> 02:07:38,119
Now I understand.

1376
02:07:40,080 --> 02:07:41,799
Of course.

1377
02:07:41,800 --> 02:07:43,638
Don't think about these now.

1378
02:07:43,960 --> 02:07:45,959
Because, no matter what happens..

1379
02:07:46,240 --> 02:07:50,199
..being family means staying together.

1380
02:07:52,360 --> 02:07:55,439
Your brother, sister, mother, whoever.

1381
02:07:55,440 --> 02:07:58,079
It means following after them all the time.

1382
02:07:58,080 --> 02:08:03,199
It means not leaving them alone.

1383
02:08:09,120 --> 02:08:10,319
So, Bala.

1384
02:08:13,240 --> 02:08:14,518
Our children.

1385
02:08:15,360 --> 02:08:17,079
Our children are here.

1386
02:08:17,880 --> 02:08:19,479
One other is right there.

1387
02:08:20,960 --> 02:08:23,558
And our brides are waiting us at the tribe.

1388
02:08:24,080 --> 02:08:27,079
My alps are with us as well.

1389
02:08:27,480 --> 02:08:29,919
My beys are with us too.

1390
02:08:30,639 --> 02:08:31,999
May you prosper, my Bey.

1391
02:08:35,760 --> 02:08:36,999
Thank Allah.

1392
02:08:37,000 --> 02:08:40,558
Is there blessing greater in this world?

1393
02:08:41,000 --> 02:08:42,239
No, my Bey.

1394
02:08:44,400 --> 02:08:46,479
We do not need more.

1395
02:08:51,160 --> 02:08:52,319
Father.

1396
02:08:54,160 --> 02:08:55,319
Father?

1397
02:08:55,320 --> 02:08:58,119
Mother.

1398
02:08:59,400 --> 02:09:00,479
Yes, dear?

1399
02:09:09,559 --> 02:09:11,479
Come here then.

1400
02:09:13,720 --> 02:09:17,279
Father, you said.

1401
02:09:17,680 --> 02:09:18,799
Father.

1402
02:09:24,720 --> 02:09:27,359
I thought about it a lot and made a decision.

1403
02:09:27,360 --> 02:09:28,598
What is it? Tell us.

1404
02:09:29,960 --> 02:09:33,439
Even though my sins have
taken me far from you...

1405
02:09:35,280 --> 02:09:37,759
...I don't want to be away from you anymore.

1406
02:09:40,519 --> 02:09:43,759
Like you..

1407
02:09:43,880 --> 02:09:48,518
..I want to believe in Allah Who makes
those who choose their path sinless...

1408
02:09:51,760 --> 02:09:53,558
...as if they were born again.

1409
02:09:59,480 --> 02:10:00,919
Hay Praise be.

1410
02:10:06,160 --> 02:10:07,439
Thanks to my Allah...

1411
02:10:08,200 --> 02:10:10,959
...Who created you and granted you to us.

1412
02:10:11,040 --> 02:10:12,479
Thanks to Him.

1413
02:10:12,480 --> 02:10:14,518
My beautiful daughter.

1414
02:10:14,800 --> 02:10:16,399
My Halime.

1415
02:10:16,599 --> 02:10:17,959
My mother's name...

1416
02:10:19,080 --> 02:10:21,799
You filled our hearts with joy.

1417
02:10:26,920 --> 02:10:29,679
The dear one of her mother...

1418
02:10:30,599 --> 02:10:33,399
I can't get enough of hugging you.

1419
02:10:41,760 --> 02:10:42,638
Now..

1420
02:10:45,160 --> 02:10:46,959
...you will repeat after me.

1421
02:10:48,519 --> 02:10:52,199
I bear witness that there is none
worthy of worship except Allah..

1422
02:10:55,080 --> 02:10:58,719
I bear witness that there is none
worthy of worship except Allah...

1423
02:10:58,720 --> 02:11:03,279
...and I bear witness that Muhammad
is His servant and Messenger.

1424
02:11:04,960 --> 02:11:10,199
...and I bear witness that Muhammad
is His servant and Messenger.

1425
02:11:19,200 --> 02:11:23,279
Just as your return and our reunion,
may it be blessed, my daughter.

1426
02:11:26,400 --> 02:11:27,479
Aameen.

1427
02:11:28,840 --> 02:11:29,638
Aameen.

1428
02:11:29,639 --> 02:11:30,959
Aameen my Bey.

1429
02:11:36,519 --> 02:11:38,159
Wait.

1430
02:11:41,680 --> 02:11:42,518
Look.

1431
02:11:42,639 --> 02:11:45,239
This was a gift from your father.

1432
02:11:46,320 --> 02:11:49,079
I used to hug this when you were gone.

1433
02:11:51,080 --> 02:11:53,719
Now it's my gift to you, my daughter.

1434
02:11:54,480 --> 02:11:57,239
Bless your salvation, God willing.

1435
02:12:07,440 --> 02:12:12,799
That's how it works. The water
of truth always finds its way.

1436
02:12:16,160 --> 02:12:22,638
As long as our hearts are full of faith and 
our cause is always the way of The Righteous...

1437
02:12:22,680 --> 02:12:25,598
...this water will surely find its way.

1438
02:12:26,519 --> 02:12:30,959
And we will always be the ones who
reach happiness on the path of conquest.

1439
02:12:30,960 --> 02:12:33,319
God willing my Bey.

1440
02:12:54,920 --> 02:12:58,279
Welcome Osman Bey!

1441
02:13:02,480 --> 02:13:22,239
Long live Osman Bey!

1442
02:13:23,800 --> 02:13:28,598
Long live Osman Bey!

1443
02:13:43,240 --> 02:13:47,439
Long live Osman Bey!

1444
02:13:47,559 --> 02:13:50,598
Thank you, live long.

1445
02:13:51,080 --> 02:13:52,439
Live long.

1446
02:13:52,840 --> 02:13:54,239
Welcome, my Bey.

1447
02:13:54,240 --> 02:13:57,598
They wanted your state and they were destroyed.

1448
02:13:57,599 --> 02:14:00,359
They wanted your child
and were defeated, my Bey.

1449
02:14:00,360 --> 02:14:10,719
Long live Osman Bey!

1450
02:14:18,040 --> 02:14:19,598
O, my people!

1451
02:14:19,680 --> 02:14:21,479
My Beys, my sisters!

1452
02:14:21,880 --> 02:14:25,719
Thanks to my Allah, we returned
victorious to our tribe again.

1453
02:14:26,360 --> 02:14:28,079
Know this..

1454
02:14:28,120 --> 02:14:33,799
Victory belongs only to those who believe
and whose hearts burn with the fire of faith.

1455
02:14:33,960 --> 02:14:51,479
Long live Osman Bey!

1456
02:15:12,960 --> 02:15:16,999
Welcome Osman Bey!

1457
02:15:17,040 --> 02:15:20,359
Thank you.

1458
02:15:20,360 --> 02:15:21,558
My Alaeddin!

1459
02:15:21,680 --> 02:15:22,719
My Hatun..

1460
02:15:25,080 --> 02:15:26,399
My dear Gonca...

1461
02:15:26,400 --> 02:15:29,039
You were wounded while running
away. Are you alright, my Hatun?

1462
02:15:29,040 --> 02:15:30,279
I am alright, I am alright.

1463
02:15:30,559 --> 02:15:32,799
You came back safely. Scholar...

1464
02:15:33,120 --> 02:15:35,558
It no longer hurts...

1465
02:15:36,320 --> 02:15:38,239
Thanks to Allah...
Thanks to Allah...

1466
02:15:41,720 --> 02:15:46,279
My Hatun... My Hatun...

1467
02:15:46,280 --> 02:15:48,638
Thanks to Allah, I came together with you.

1468
02:15:49,280 --> 02:15:53,558
Thanks to Allah Who gave you, our child...

1469
02:15:54,599 --> 02:15:58,119
...and my siblings to me.

1470
02:16:04,720 --> 02:16:06,759
My Fatma

1471
02:16:07,680 --> 02:16:09,039
Thanks to Allah...

1472
02:16:09,240 --> 02:16:11,799
I kept waiting for you, I was so afraid.

1473
02:16:18,840 --> 02:16:21,359
We returned, my Fatma. We returned.

1474
02:16:21,559 --> 02:16:28,159
We saved your brothers
with your sister and returned.

1475
02:16:30,200 --> 02:16:32,279
Thank you.

1476
02:16:36,039 --> 02:16:38,798
All the Beys are waiting for you.

1477
02:16:38,799 --> 02:16:40,239
They are all ready, my Bey.

1478
02:16:41,200 --> 02:16:42,718
Thanks, thanks.

1479
02:16:48,080 --> 02:16:50,878
O, Ertugrul Ghazi's Dark Osman.

1480
02:16:53,200 --> 02:16:54,999
Praise be to you.

1481
02:17:01,240 --> 02:17:02,478
Attention!

1482
02:17:02,840 --> 02:17:05,679
Osman Bey the ruler of the state!

1483
02:17:19,080 --> 02:17:21,359
Are the preparations complete, Koca Bey?

1484
02:17:21,558 --> 02:17:23,318
As you ordered, my Bey.

1485
02:17:26,039 --> 02:17:28,638
Do not let anyone into the council.

1486
02:17:40,440 --> 02:17:41,878
Peace be upon you.

1487
02:17:42,379 --> 02:17:44,179
Peace be upon you too my Bey!

1488
02:17:49,680 --> 02:17:54,334
I open our council with
Almighty Allah's 99 names

1489
02:17:54,346 --> 02:17:58,919
Who holds us responsible
for effort, not victory.

1490
02:17:59,680 --> 02:18:01,638
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

1491
02:18:03,400 --> 02:18:04,999
Kayi's brave Beys...

1492
02:18:06,039 --> 02:18:07,279
...honest Beys.

1493
02:18:08,200 --> 02:18:10,679
We organized a council and invited you.

1494
02:18:11,080 --> 02:18:15,038
You did not reject and came here. Thank you.

1495
02:18:17,280 --> 02:18:21,679
If you are the one inviting, we will
come running no matter what, my Bey.

1496
02:18:21,959 --> 02:18:23,599
Thank you, thank you.

1497
02:18:24,080 --> 02:18:27,038
The council we hold today...

1498
02:18:28,119 --> 02:18:31,118
...is the sign of the tough
battle we will face tomorrow.

1499
02:18:31,520 --> 02:18:34,439
What a blessed news this is!

1500
02:18:34,799 --> 02:18:38,759
What a blessed news this is, Osman Bey!

1501
02:18:40,799 --> 02:18:45,118
This heart keeps burning for that battle.

1502
02:18:49,600 --> 02:18:50,798
We heard that..

1503
02:18:52,440 --> 02:18:54,638
...the jackal and hyena have united.

1504
02:18:55,119 --> 02:18:57,839
And they settled in Bursa, our target.

1505
02:18:59,080 --> 02:19:00,439
But they don't know that...

1506
02:19:01,400 --> 02:19:02,878
...the wolf never sleeps...

1507
02:19:04,160 --> 02:19:06,359
...on a cold night.

1508
02:19:06,959 --> 02:19:08,839
Is our first target Bursa, my Bey?

1509
02:19:09,000 --> 02:19:10,798
Bursa is always our target.

1510
02:19:11,959 --> 02:19:14,038
It is the goal in our hearts.

1511
02:19:14,638 --> 02:19:22,398
But the moves we make in this war
will bring us closer to Bursa step by step.

1512
02:19:23,240 --> 02:19:31,159
Now our first target is the Ilkhanid army
coming from Enguru to these frontiers.

1513
02:19:33,959 --> 02:19:37,118
And the soldiers of Claudius
who want to unite with them.

1514
02:19:37,840 --> 02:19:42,919
We will never allow our enemies
to unite and come upon us.

1515
02:19:43,039 --> 02:19:46,919
We will ruin them! We will destroy them!

1516
02:19:49,640 --> 02:19:52,817
We will place the Akinji
tribes who come to pledge

1517
02:19:52,829 --> 02:19:56,519
allegiance on the lands we
will conquer and take from them.

1518
02:19:57,160 --> 02:20:03,639
And so we will slowly spread around Bursa.

1519
02:20:05,200 --> 02:20:06,038
This is...

1520
02:20:06,960 --> 02:20:08,679
...such a conquest that...

1521
02:20:08,800 --> 02:20:10,239
...not only the Alps...

1522
02:20:11,680 --> 02:20:15,319
...but also the young valiants
whose mustaches are just growing...

1523
02:20:15,560 --> 02:20:18,239
...and the elderly who can still hold swords...

1524
02:20:18,640 --> 02:20:19,479
All of them...

1525
02:20:20,680 --> 02:20:23,879
All of them will become soldiers for this cause.

1526
02:20:24,520 --> 02:20:25,399
This..

1527
02:20:27,840 --> 02:20:30,079
This will be such a war that..

1528
02:20:32,000 --> 02:20:33,919
It will be the bloodiest war...

1529
02:20:34,560 --> 02:20:36,799
...these lands have ever witnessed.

1530
02:20:43,480 --> 02:20:46,199
The blows we will strike against our enemies...

1531
02:20:46,840 --> 02:20:47,839
..in the east..

1532
02:20:49,480 --> 02:20:50,359
..the west..

1533
02:20:51,720 --> 02:20:55,359
..at the frontiers, beyond the frontiers...

1534
02:20:56,760 --> 02:21:00,719
...will be the moves of the
conquest that will change the order.

1535
02:21:06,119 --> 02:21:08,839
This sword which is drawn from its sheath...

1536
02:21:09,320 --> 02:21:11,999
...will not be put back into its sheath...

1537
02:21:12,880 --> 02:21:16,959
...until it brings justice and
order to these frontiers and lands.

1538
02:21:22,119 --> 02:21:23,959
The steps we take today...

1539
02:21:27,240 --> 02:21:28,639
...will spread like...

1540
02:21:30,240 --> 02:21:31,959
...an avalanche across this land.

1541
02:21:32,280 --> 02:21:36,559
Allah is the Greatest!

1542
02:21:37,360 --> 02:21:44,419
Allah is the Greatest!

1543
02:21:59,103 --> 02:22:01,283
Who sent it?

1544
02:22:01,736 --> 02:22:03,456
It is brought by Byzantine Emperor Andronikos'
personal messenger, my Bey.

1545
02:22:31,635 --> 02:22:34,285
The emperor invites us to Iznik.